B.aKy=new A.O("We found many IOCs so the attack is critical.","The volume of indicators is high, but the assessed impact remains moderate.","G\xf6sterge say\u0131s\u0131 \u015fiddet \xf6l\xe7\xfcs\xfc de\u011fildir; \u015fiddet etkiyle \xf6l\xe7\xfcl\xfcr ve her olay\u0131 critical olarak etiketlemek uyar\u0131lar\u0131n ciddiye al\u0131nmamas\u0131na yol a\xe7ar.",null)
B.aPs=new A.O("The group made a phishing to our employees.","The group targeted our employees with a phishing campaign.","phishing fiil e\u015fi make de\u011fildir; hedef alma anlam\u0131 target, launch ya da conduct fiilleriyle kurulur ve phishing campaign bir blok olarak \xf6\u011frenilir.",null)
B.aNX=new A.O("According to me, this actor is the same as last year's.","In our assessment, this is likely the same actor as last year.","according to yaln\u0131zca ba\u015fka bir kaynak i\xe7in kullan\u0131l\u0131r; kendi de\u011ferlendirmen in our assessment ya da we assess kal\u0131plar\u0131yla verilir ve olas\u0131l\u0131k likely ile \xf6l\xe7eklenir.",null)
