B.c6y=new A.bw("cs-02-cti","CTI dili: at\u0131f, g\xfcven derecesi ve \u015fiddeti dille ayarlamak","Bu ad\u0131mda tehdit istihbarat\u0131n\u0131n kendine \xf6zg\xfc dilini \xf6\u011freniyorsun: bir bulguyu iddia etmeden aktarma, atf\u0131 (attribution) do\u011fru g\xfcven derecesiyle s\xf6yleme ve \u015fiddeti abartmadan anlatma. CTI yaz\u0131m\u0131n\u0131n en belirleyici \xf6zelli\u011fi kesinlik derecesinin dille kodlanmas\u0131d\u0131r; ayn\u0131 bulgu we assess with moderate confidence ile yaz\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda profesyonel, it is definitely ile yaz\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda amat\xf6r durur. T\xfcrk\xe7e konu\u015fanlar\u0131n en s\u0131k hatas\u0131 kesinlik fazlal\u0131\u011f\u0131d\u0131r: T\xfcrk\xe7ede do\u011fal olan kesin ifade \u0130ngilizce raporda kan\u0131tlanamayan bir iddiaya d\xf6n\xfc\u015f\xfcr. Bu ad\u0131mda hem CTI terim havuzunu hem o havuzu ta\u015f\u0131yan hedging dilini kuracaks\u0131n.",B.blj,B.bqI,B.bct,"Kelime tekrar\u0131 b\xf6l\xfcm\xfcnde CTI terim paketini \xfc\xe7 katmanda \xe7al\u0131\u015f: g\xf6zlem (IOC, hash, domain, C2), davran\u0131\u015f (TTP, lateral movement, persistence, exfiltration) ve akt\xf6r (threat actor, APT, affiliate, broker). Her kart\u0131n arkas\u0131na terimin ait oldu\u011fu katman\u0131 ve raporda ge\xe7ti\u011fi tipik c\xfcmleyi yaz. Ayr\u0131ca bir kartta g\xfcven \xf6l\xe7e\u011fini (high, moderate, low confidence), bir kartta y\xfcklem \xf6l\xe7e\u011fini zay\u0131ftan g\xfc\xe7l\xfcye (is consistent with, suggests, indicates, strongly suggests, confirms) tut ve her oturumda kesin yaz\u0131lm\u0131\u015f bir c\xfcmleyi \xfc\xe7 farkl\u0131 g\xfcven kademesine d\xf6n\xfc\u015ft\xfcrme al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rmas\u0131 yap. Peki\u015fen kartlarda write modunu kullan.",B.M7,null,null,null,null)
B.aYj=new A.r("Alan terimleri ve ald\u0131klar\u0131 fiiller","SIGINT ailesinin alt k\xfcmeleri k\u0131saltmayla ayr\u0131l\u0131r: COMINT ileti\u015fim i\xe7eri\u011fi, ELINT elektronik yay\u0131n, FISINT yabanc\u0131 ara\xe7 sinyalleri, MASINT \xf6l\xe7\xfcm ve imza istihbarat\u0131d\u0131r. Terimlerin fiil e\u015fleri sabittir: intercept a transmission, capture packets, correlate two data sets, geolocate a transmitter, decrypt traffic, fingerprint a device. traffic analysis i\xe7eri\u011fi de\u011fil deseni inceler ve bu ayr\u0131m c\xfcmlede korunmal\u0131d\u0131r: Even without decryption, traffic analysis revealed a regular beaconing pattern. S\u0131k kullan\u0131lan isimler edatlar\u0131yla \xf6\u011frenilir: interference with, access to, insight into, correlation between, exposure of. Yanl\u0131\u015f edat c\xfcmleyi hemen yabanc\u0131 yapar. Bu alanda bir\xe7ok isim ayn\u0131 zamanda fiildir ve baz\u0131lar\u0131nda vurgu yeri de\u011fi\u015fir: record isim olarak birinci hecede (REC-ord), fiil olarak ikinci hecede (re-CORD) vurgulan\u0131r; suspect ve conduct da b\xf6yledir. Ama her \xe7ift b\xf6yle de\u011fildir: monitor hem isim hem fiildir ve vurgusu hep birinci hecededir (MON-i-tor), transmit ile transmission ise vurguyu ayn\u0131 hecede tutar (trans-MIT, trans-MIS-sion).")
B.aVX=new A.r("Edilgen yap\u0131: faili s\xf6ylemeden g\xf6zlemi yazmak","Edilgen \xe7at\u0131 bu alanda \xfcslup tercihi de\u011fil zorunluluktur: fail bilinmedi\u011finde, \xf6nemsiz oldu\u011funda ya da gizlendi\u011finde nesne \xf6ne al\u0131n\u0131r. The transmission was intercepted at 04:12 UTC. Edilgen c\xfcmle be + \xfc\xe7\xfcnc\xfc h\xe2l ile kurulur ve zaman be fiilinde ta\u015f\u0131n\u0131r: is monitored, was intercepted, has been correlated, had been encrypted, will be reviewed. Faili eklemek istiyorsan by kullan\u0131l\u0131r ama bu alanda \xe7o\u011fu zaman eklenmez; eklenmemesi bilgi eksikli\u011fi de\u011fil bilin\xe7li bir se\xe7imdir. Edilgen yap\u0131y\u0131 abartmak metni okunamaz h\xe2le getirir; tavsiye ve eylem c\xfcmleleri etken yaz\u0131l\u0131r: We recommend rotating the keys, not It is recommended that keys be rotated wherever possible. get-passive (it got flagged) konu\u015fma dilindedir ve resm\xee raporda kullan\u0131lmaz; rapor dilinde be-passive standartt\u0131r.")
B.aUa=new A.r("Zaman se\xe7imi: past simple, present perfect, past perfect","past simple kapanm\u0131\u015f ve zaman\u0131 belirtilmi\u015f olaylar\u0131 anlat\u0131r: The operator changed infrastructure on 12 March. Tarih varsa neredeyse her zaman past simple kullan\u0131l\u0131r. present perfect sonucu h\xe2l\xe2 ge\xe7erli olan ya da s\xfcresi bitmemi\u015f g\xf6zlemleri anlat\u0131r: We have observed three similar campaigns since January. since ve for bu zamanla gelir. past perfect olaydan \xf6ncesini i\u015faretler ve olay s\u0131ras\u0131n\u0131 netle\u015ftirir: By the time we isolated the host, the data had already been exfiltrated. Devam eden bir izlemeyi present perfect continuous ta\u015f\u0131r: The domain has been resolving to the same IP for six weeks. T\xfcrk\xe7e tek ge\xe7mi\u015f zamanla \xfc\xe7 durumu birden anlatabildi\u011fi i\xe7in bu \xfc\xe7 zaman\u0131n kar\u0131\u015fmas\u0131 en s\u0131k g\xf6r\xfclen hatad\u0131r; tarih varsa past simple, since ya da for varsa present perfect refleksini kur.")
