B.aKz=new A.O("It is recommended that the keys would be rotated.","We recommend rotating the keys.","Tavsiyeyi edilgen ve ko\u015fullu yazmak sorumlulu\u011fu belirsizle\u015ftirir ve okunurlu\u011fu d\xfc\u015f\xfcr\xfcr; rapor dilinde eylem c\xfcmleleri etken ve k\u0131sad\u0131r.",null)
B.aL6=new A.O("The device got flagged in the report.","The device was flagged in the report.","get-passive konu\u015fma diline aittir ve resm\xee raporda \xfcslup hatas\u0131 say\u0131l\u0131r; yaz\u0131l\u0131 istihbarat dilinde be-passive standartt\u0131r.",null)
