B.aJ3=new A.O("Your detection team totally failed here.","The gap is visibility in that segment \u2014 detection couldn't have seen it.","K\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131-mavi tart\u0131\u015fmas\u0131nda ki\u015fiye ya da ekibe y\xf6nelen su\xe7lama i\u015f birli\u011fini bitirir; sorun her zaman g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcrl\xfck, s\xfcre\xe7 ya da yap\u0131land\u0131rma d\xfczeyinde adland\u0131r\u0131l\u0131r.",null)
