B.aKI=new A.O("I look up every unknown word in the report as soon as I see it.","I finish the paragraph, guess the word's job, and use the dictionary only if the meaning is still stuck.","Bu bir dil de\u011fil y\xf6ntem hatas\u0131d\u0131r: rapordaki her bilinmeyen kelimeye tek tek s\xf6zl\xfckten bakmak okuma ak\u0131\u015f\u0131n\u0131 k\u0131rar ve peki\u015fmeyi d\xfc\u015f\xfcr\xfcr; paragraf\u0131 bitirip kelimenin i\u015flevini tahmin etmek ve s\xf6zl\xfc\u011f\xfc yaln\u0131zca anlam kilitlenince a\xe7mak hem h\u0131z\u0131 hem kal\u0131c\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131 art\u0131r\u0131r, rapordan en fazla on kelime almak da yeterlidir.",null)
B.aJW=new A.O("The incident was occurred last night.","The incident occurred last night.","occur ge\xe7i\u015fsiz bir fiildir ve edilgen \xe7at\u0131ya girmez; rapor dilinde edilgen yap\u0131 yayg\u0131n oldu\u011fu i\xe7in bu hata \xf6zellikle s\u0131k yap\u0131l\u0131r.",null)
B.aOC=new A.O("Our cyber security team informations show a different picture.","Our cybersecurity team's information shows a different picture.","As\u0131l hata information'dad\u0131r: say\u0131lamaz, \xe7o\u011ful olmaz (informations yoktur) ve tekil fiil al\u0131r (shows); sahiplik de iki ismi yan yana dizmek yerine iyelikle daha do\u011fal verilir (our team's information). cybersecurity ise s\xf6zl\xfcklerde ve Amerikan yaz\u0131m\u0131nda tek kelimedir; \u0130ngiliz resm\xee yaz\u0131m\u0131nda cyber security de standartt\u0131r, yani bu k\u0131s\u0131m hata de\u011fil tercihtir ama tek metinde ikisini kar\u0131\u015ft\u0131rma. Bu hatalar bir arada bir raporun ilk sat\u0131r\u0131nda seviyeyi hemen d\xfc\u015f\xfcr\xfcr.",null)
B.aJq=new A.O("We eventually mitigated the actual vulnerability.","We may have mitigated the current vulnerability.","S\xf6ylemek istedi\u011fin \u015fey g\xfcncel zafiyeti muhtemelen azaltt\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z ise eventually ve actual yanl\u0131\u015f kelimelerdir: T\xfcrk\xe7edeki event\xfcel (olas\u0131) ve akt\xfcel (g\xfcncel) kelimelerine benzeseler de eventually sonunda, actual ise ger\xe7ek anlam\u0131ndad\u0131r; c\xfcmle b\xf6ylece azaltman\u0131n kesin olarak ger\xe7ekle\u015fti\u011fini s\xf6yler ve kastedilenden bamba\u015fka bir \u015fey anlat\u0131r. Olas\u0131l\u0131k i\xe7in may have ya da possibly, g\xfcncel i\xe7in current kullan\u0131l\u0131r.",null)
B.b95=s([B.aKI,B.aJW,B.aOC,B.aJq],t.Z)
B.c6K=new A.bw("cs-08-vocab-700","Yedi y\xfcz kelime: CTI raporlar\u0131n\u0131 s\xf6zl\xfcks\xfcz okumak","Bu ad\u0131m siber patikan\u0131n mihenk ta\u015f\u0131: yedi y\xfcz kelimelik bir havuzla CTI raporlar\u0131n\u0131, dan\u0131\u015fmanl\u0131k b\xfcltenlerini ve sat\u0131c\u0131 belgelerini s\xf6zl\xfck a\xe7madan okuyabilmek. Bu \xf6l\xe7ekte hedef her kelimeyi hat\u0131rlamak de\u011fil, metni yava\u015flatan kelimeyi s\u0131f\u0131ra indirmektir; okuma h\u0131z\u0131n\u0131 d\xfc\u015f\xfcren \u015fey genellikle terimler de\u011fil, terimleri ba\u011flayan akademik yap\u0131 kelimeleridir. Bu y\xfczden havuzun \xfc\xe7 katman\u0131 olmal\u0131: alan terimleri, s\xfcre\xe7 fiilleri ve rapor dilinin ba\u011flay\u0131c\u0131lar\u0131. Bu ders havuzu kurman\u0131n ve \xfcretime \xe7evirmenin y\xf6ntemini verir.",B.bss,B.bsC,B.b95,"Kelime tekrar\u0131 b\xf6l\xfcm\xfcnde siber kelime havuzunun tamam\u0131n\u0131 \xfc\xe7 katmanda \xe7al\u0131\u015f: alan terimleri, s\xfcre\xe7 fiilleri (observe, assess, attribute, corroborate, remediate, escalate, enumerate) ve rapor ba\u011flay\u0131c\u0131lar\u0131 (notably, consequently, albeit, whereas, to date, thereby, insofar as). G\xfcnde yirmi yeni kart a\xe7; her kartta kelime ailesini (attribute / attribution / attributable), bir e\u015fdizimi ve raporun kendi c\xfcmlesini tut. Haftada bir ger\xe7ek bir CTI raporunu \xfc\xe7 paragrafta \xf6zetle (g\xf6zlem, de\u011ferlendirme, tavsiye) ve ald\u0131\u011f\u0131n her kelimeyi k\u0131rk sekiz saat i\xe7inde bir rapor paragraf\u0131nda ya da bir k\xf6pr\xfc konu\u015fmas\u0131nda \xfcret; peki\u015fen kartlarda write ve cloze modlar\u0131n\u0131 kullan ve yalanc\u0131 e\u015f dostlar\u0131 ayr\u0131 bir listede do\u011fru-yanl\u0131\u015f \xe7iftiyle tekrar et.",B.j,null,null,null,null)
