B.aNZ=new A.O("The lesson was very boring, I was boring.","The lesson was very boring, so I was bored.","-ing s\u0131fat\u0131 durumun kendisini, -ed s\u0131fat\u0131 ki\u015finin hissetti\u011fini anlat\u0131r; ikisi kar\u0131\u015f\u0131nca anlam tersine d\xf6ner. \u0130ki c\xfcmleyi yaln\u0131zca virg\xfclle yan yana koymak yerine so ile ba\u011flamak da gerekir.",null)
