B.c5D=new A.bw("g-b06-vocab-300","300 kelime: g\xfcnl\xfck hayat\u0131n y\xfcksek frekansl\u0131 fiil ve isimleri","Bu ad\u0131mda kelime havuzunu 300'e \xe7\u0131kar\u0131yorsun ve art\u0131k sadece nesne ad\u0131 de\u011fil, i\u015f yapan fiiller ve ba\u011flay\u0131c\u0131 kelimeler ekliyorsun. 300 kelime, basit g\xfcnl\xfck konular\u0131 kendi c\xfcmlelerinle anlatabilmen i\xe7in gereken e\u015fiktir: al\u0131\u015fveri\u015f, yol tarifi, hava durumu, basit duygular. Bu ad\u0131mda ayr\u0131ca T\xfcrk\xe7eye benzeyen ama anlam\u0131 farkl\u0131 olan sahte dostlara dikkat etmeyi \xf6\u011freneceksin.",B.by0,B.bk1,B.btC,"Kelime tekrar\u0131 b\xf6l\xfcm\xfcnde 300 kelime havuzunu T\xfcrk\xe7eden \u0130ngilizceye y\xf6n\xfcnde \xe7al\u0131\u015f; make ve do ile giden kelimeleri ayr\u0131 bir listeye ay\u0131r ve her birini kendi g\xfcnl\xfck rutininden bir c\xfcmleyle tekrar et.",B.j,null,null,null,null)
B.aT8=new A.r("Kar\u015f\u0131la\u015ft\u0131rma: bigger, cheaper, more expensive","Al\u0131\u015fveri\u015fte iki \u015feyi k\u0131yaslars\u0131n; \u0130ngilizcede k\u0131sa s\u0131fatlara '-er' gelir, uzunlara 'more' eklenir: 'The large one is bigger.', 'This coffee is cheaper than that one.', 'The blue jacket is more expensive.' Kar\u015f\u0131la\u015ft\u0131rd\u0131\u011f\u0131n \u015feyi 'than' ile ba\u011fla: 'Tea is cheaper than coffee.' \u2014 T\xfcrk\xe7edeki '-den' ekinin kar\u015f\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131d\u0131r, 'from' DE\u011e\u0130L. 'good/bad' d\xfczensizdir: better / worse. En \xfcst\xfcn i\xe7in 'the' \u015fart: 'the cheapest', 'the most expensive'. Kafede karar verirken 'Which one is bigger?' ve 'Is this one cheaper?' sorular\u0131 seni ak\u0131c\u0131 g\xf6sterir.")
B.aRL=new A.r("\u0130stemek de\u011fil rica etmek","T\xfcrk\xe7ede 'Bir kahve alay\u0131m' ya da 'Bir kahve istiyorum' tamamen normaldir; \u0130ngilizcede 'I want a coffee' ise sert ve kaba duyulur. Do\u011fal kal\u0131plar \u015funlard\u0131r: 'Can I have a coffee, please?', 'Could I get a latte?', 'I'd like a tea, please.' please kelimesi kibarl\u0131\u011f\u0131 tek ba\u015f\u0131na kurtarmaz; as\u0131l i\u015fi yapan Can I have ve I'd like kal\u0131plar\u0131d\u0131r. I'd like, I would like'\u0131n k\u0131saltmas\u0131d\u0131r ve restoran ile ma\u011fazada en g\xfcvenli se\xe7imdir.")
B.aX4=new A.r("Garsonun sorular\u0131n\u0131 anlamak","Sipari\u015f s\u0131ras\u0131nda sana sorulacak sorular s\u0131n\u0131rl\u0131d\u0131r ve hep ayn\u0131d\u0131r: 'For here or to go?' (burada m\u0131, paket mi), 'Anything else?' (ba\u015fka bir \u015fey?), 'What size?' (hangi boy?). Kahve boylar\u0131 genelde small, medium, large ya da zincir kafelerde farkl\u0131 adlarla gelir. Bilmedi\u011fin bir \u015fey sorulursa panikleme, 'Sorry, could you say that again?' demek tamamen normaldir. Ne se\xe7ece\u011fini bilmiyorsan 'What do you recommend?' sorusu hem i\u015fini g\xf6r\xfcr hem do\u011fal duyulur.")
B.b_T=new A.r("Hesap, \xf6deme ve bah\u015fi\u015f","Hesab\u0131 isterken emir kipi kullanma; do\u011fal kal\u0131p 'Could I get the bill, please?' ya da Amerika'da 'Can we get the check?' \u015feklindedir. Kartla \xf6demenin en do\u011fal kal\u0131b\u0131 'Can I pay by card?' sorusudur; by card artikelsiz sabit bir kal\u0131pt\u0131r. with kullan\u0131rsan artikel gerekir: 'with a card', 'with my credit card' \u2014 artikelsiz 'with card' de\u011fil. Nakit \xf6derken \xfcst\xfcn\xfc b\u0131rakmak istersen 'Keep the change' dersin. Kart makinesi uzat\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda 'Contactless?' ya da 'Do you need my PIN?' gibi k\u0131sa sorular yeterlidir.")
B.b1E=new A.r("Ma\u011fazada: beden, deneme ve iade","Ma\u011fazada en \xe7ok kullanaca\u011f\u0131n \xfc\xe7 kal\u0131p \u015funlard\u0131r: 'Do you have this in medium?', 'Can I try it on?', 'Where are the fitting rooms?' Sadece bak\u0131yorsan ve yard\u0131m teklif edilirse 'I'm just looking, thanks' demek kibarca reddetmenin standart yoludur. \u0130ade i\xe7in 'I'd like to return this' ve para iadesi i\xe7in 'I'd like a refund' kal\u0131plar\u0131 kullan\u0131l\u0131r; fi\u015f i\xe7in receipt kelimesi ge\xe7er. T\xfcrk\xe7ede tek bir 'iade' kelimesi vard\u0131r, \u0130ngilizcede \xfcr\xfcn\xfc geri vermek return, paray\u0131 geri almak refund ile anlat\u0131l\u0131r.")
