B.c7b=new A.bw("g-b07-cafe-shop","Kafe ve ma\u011faza: sipari\u015f ver, fiyat sor, hesab\u0131 iste","Bu ad\u0131m\u0131n sonunda bir kafede sipari\u015f verebilecek, ma\u011fazada beden ve fiyat sorabilecek ve hesab\u0131 kibarca isteyebileceksin. Bunlar yurt d\u0131\u015f\u0131nda ilk g\xfcnden itibaren kullanaca\u011f\u0131n, hata yap\u0131nca da en \xe7ok utan\u0131lan konu\u015fmalard\u0131r; haz\u0131r kal\u0131plarla girersen stres b\xfcy\xfck \xf6l\xe7\xfcde biter. Ayr\u0131ca \u0130ngilizcede kibarl\u0131\u011f\u0131n kelime se\xe7imiyle de\u011fil, c\xfcmle kal\u0131b\u0131yla kuruldu\u011funu g\xf6receksin.",B.b3b,B.bgt,B.b8w,"Roleplay senaryosunda cafe etiketli be\u015f sahneyi s\u0131rayla tamamla: kahve sipari\u015fi, men\xfc tavsiyesi, hesap isteme, ma\u011fazada beden sorma ve iade; her sahnede en az bir kez What do you recommend ya da Can I try it on kal\u0131b\u0131n\u0131 kullan.",B.bzd,null,null,null,null)
B.aVP=new A.r("D\xfczenli fiiller: -ed eki ve \xfc\xe7 farkl\u0131 okunu\u015fu","D\xfczenli fiillerde ge\xe7mi\u015f zaman -ed ekiyle kurulur: work - worked, play - played, start - started. Ama bu ek \xfc\xe7 farkl\u0131 okunur: sessiz ve sert seslerden sonra /t/ (worked), yumu\u015fak seslerden sonra /d/ (played), t ve d ile bitenlerden sonra ayr\u0131 hece olarak /\u026ad/ (wanted, needed). T\xfcrk \xf6\u011frenciler \xe7o\u011funlukla hepsini ayr\u0131 hece gibi okur ve bu, konu\u015fmay\u0131 hem yava\u015flat\u0131r hem yapay g\xf6sterir. Sadece t/d ile biten fiillerde heceyi ekle, di\u011ferlerinde eki sese yap\u0131\u015ft\u0131r.")
B.aRz=new A.r("D\xfczensiz fiiller: ezber de\u011fil, gruplama","En s\u0131k kullan\u0131lan fiillerin \xe7o\u011fu d\xfczensizdir: go - went, see - saw, have - had, do - did, take - took, come - came. Bunlar\u0131 alfabetik liste h\xe2linde ezberlemek verimsizdir; ses benzerli\u011fine g\xf6re gruplamak \xe7ok daha h\u0131zl\u0131d\u0131r: drink - drank, sing - sang, swim - swam bir grup; buy - bought, think - thought, bring - brought ba\u015fka bir grup. Her gruptan bir \xf6rnek c\xfcmle kur ve o c\xfcmleyi hat\u0131rla; kelime de\u011fil c\xfcmle hat\u0131rlamak daha kal\u0131c\u0131d\u0131r. \u0130lk elli d\xfczensiz fiil, g\xfcnl\xfck konu\u015fmadaki ge\xe7mi\u015f zaman ihtiyac\u0131n\u0131n neredeyse tamam\u0131n\u0131 kar\u015f\u0131lar.")
B.aTY=new A.r("Olumsuz ve soruda did, fiili yal\u0131na d\xf6nd\xfcr\xfcr","Olumsuzda didn't, soruda did kullan\u0131l\u0131r ve bu yard\u0131mc\u0131 fiil ge\xe7mi\u015f bilgisini \xfcstlenir: 'I didn't go', 'Did you go?' Bu y\xfczden ana fiil yal\u0131n h\xe2line d\xf6ner: 'I didn't went' yanl\u0131\u015ft\u0131r. Bu kural d\xfczensiz fiillerde de aynen ge\xe7erlidir: 'Did you see it?' \u2014 saw de\u011fil see. T\xfcrk\xe7ede ge\xe7mi\u015f eki fiilin i\xe7inde kal\u0131r ve olumsuzda kaybolmaz; \u0130ngilizcedeki bu geri d\xf6n\xfc\u015f al\u0131\u015fkanl\u0131k kurmay\u0131 gerektirir.")
B.aSL=new A.r("Ge\xe7mi\u015f zaman i\u015faretleri ve hik\xe2ye ak\u0131\u015f\u0131","yesterday, last night, last week, two days ago, in 2019 gibi ifadeler c\xfcmleyi do\u011frudan ge\xe7mi\u015fe sabitler. ago kelimesi T\xfcrk\xe7edeki '\xf6nce' gibi say\u0131dan sonra gelir: 'three years ago', 'ago three years' de\u011fil. Hik\xe2ye anlat\u0131rken olaylar\u0131 s\u0131rayla ba\u011flamak i\xe7in then, after that, in the end kullan\u0131l\u0131r. Bir c\xfcmlede zaman zarf\u0131 ge\xe7mi\u015fse fiilin de ge\xe7mi\u015f olmas\u0131 zorunludur; bu uyum bozuldu\u011funda c\xfcmle hemen yanl\u0131\u015f duyulur.")
