B.aKl=new A.O("I. WILL. NOT. DO. THAT.","I won't do that.","Hata her kelimeyi tek tek ve e\u015fit vurguyla okumakt\u0131r. Do\u011fal s\xf6yleyi\u015fte won't k\u0131salt\u0131l\u0131r ve vurgu al\u0131r, gerisi h\u0131zl\u0131 ve zay\u0131f ge\xe7er; will not'u a\xe7\u0131k s\xf6ylemek ancak \xf6zel bir vurgu istedi\u011finde do\u011fald\u0131r. \u0130ngilizcede sadece anlam ta\u015f\u0131yan kelimeler vurgulan\u0131r; her kelimeyi e\u015fit okumak c\xfcmleyi robotik yapar.",null)
B.aPA=new A.O("work-ed, play-ed","worked, played, wanted","Hata her -ed'i ayr\u0131 bir hece gibi okumakt\u0131r. -ed eki yaln\u0131zca t ve d ile biten fiillerde ayr\u0131 hece olur (wanted); di\u011ferlerinde sese yap\u0131\u015f\u0131r (worked, played).",null)
