B.aQF=new A.O("I was very stressful before the interview.","I was very stressed before the interview.","stressful durumu, stressed ise ki\u015finin hissini anlat\u0131r; ikisi kar\u0131\u015f\u0131nca kendini stres kayna\u011f\u0131 ilan etmi\u015f olursun.",null)
