B.aZe=new A.r("Akademik kay\u0131t neyi ister, neyi istemez","Akademik kay\u0131t \xfc\xe7 \u015fey ister: nesnellik (iddiay\u0131 ki\u015fiye de\u011fil kan\u0131ta ba\u011flamak), kesinlik (belirsiz kelime yerine \xf6l\xe7\xfclebilir ifade) ve \xf6l\xe7\xfcl\xfcl\xfck (abart\u0131s\u0131z y\xfcklem). \u0130stemedi\u011fi \u015feyler ise nettir: k\u0131saltmalar (don't, can't yerine do not, cannot), konu\u015fma dilinin \xf6bek fiilleri (look into yerine investigate, come up with yerine propose, get worse yerine deteriorate), belirsiz isimler (thing, stuff), okuru do\u011frudan hedef alan you ve mutlakl\u0131k bildiren always, never, everybody knows kal\u0131plar\u0131. very ve really gibi peki\u015ftiriciler akademik metinde bilgi ta\u015f\u0131maz; onlar\u0131n yerine ya bir say\u0131 ya da considerable, substantial, marked gibi \xf6l\xe7\xfc bildiren s\u0131fatlar gelir. \xdcnlem i\u015fareti, etc. k\u0131saltmas\u0131 ve retorik soru akademik metinde neredeyse hi\xe7 kullan\u0131lmaz; bir soru soracaksan onu ara\u015ft\u0131rma sorusu olarak a\xe7\u0131k\xe7a kurars\u0131n (This study asks whether\u2026). Kay\u0131t se\xe7imi \xfcslup s\xfcs\xfc de\u011fil g\xfcvenilirlik meselesidir: ayn\u0131 i\xe7erik g\xfcnl\xfck kelimelerle yaz\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda de\u011ferlendirici metni y\xfczeysel, akademik kelimelerle yaz\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda savunulabilir okur.")
B.aRx=new A.r("Nominalle\u015ftirme: fiili ve s\u0131fat\u0131 isme \xe7evirmek","Akademik \u0130ngilizcenin en belirgin \xf6zelli\u011fi nominalle\u015ftirmedir: eylem fiil yerine, nitelik de s\u0131fat yerine isim olarak ifade edilir. The temperature increased rapidly c\xfcmlesi The rapid increase in temperature h\xe2line gelir ve art\u0131k bir c\xfcmlenin \xf6znesi olabilir. Bunun iki i\u015fi vard\u0131r: bilgiyi s\u0131k\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r (tek c\xfcmlede daha \xe7ok \u015fey s\xf6ylersin) ve bilinen bilgiyi c\xfcmle ba\u015f\u0131na alarak metnin ak\u0131\u015f\u0131n\u0131 kurar (Because the sample was small\u2026 yerine The small sample size limits\u2026). S\u0131k kullan\u0131lan d\xf6n\xfc\u015f\xfcmler eklerle \xf6\u011frenilir; fiilden isme: analyse \u2192 analysis, conclude \u2192 conclusion, fail \u2192 failure; s\u0131fattan isme: absent \u2192 absence, reliable \u2192 reliability, significant \u2192 significance. Ama nominalle\u015ftirme ama\xe7 de\u011fil ara\xe7t\u0131r: \xfcst \xfcste bindi\u011finde c\xfcmle okunmaz h\xe2le gelir, isim y\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 (noun stacking) ortaya \xe7\u0131kar ve eylemi kimin yapt\u0131\u011f\u0131 kaybolur. Pratik kural: bir c\xfcmlede en fazla bir nominalle\u015ftirme kullan, c\xfcmlenin ana eylemi h\xe2l\xe2 bir fiille anlat\u0131ls\u0131n; ikinci bir isimle\u015ftirme eklemek istiyorsan c\xfcmleyi ikiye b\xf6l.")
B.b1w=new A.r("Ayn\u0131 bilgi, \xfc\xe7 kay\u0131t: mesaj, hocaya e-posta, makale","Kay\u0131t duygusunu en h\u0131zl\u0131 ayn\u0131 bilgiyi \xfc\xe7 kez yazarak kazan\u0131rs\u0131n. Mesaj: I found out the data is wrong. E-posta: I noticed a problem in the dataset and wanted to check it with you. Makale: An inconsistency was identified in the dataset. Hocaya yaz\u0131lan e-posta ikisinin aras\u0131ndad\u0131r: resm\xee hitap, tek c\xfcmlelik ama\xe7, nazik rica, net tarih ve resm\xee imza. Dear Professor Y\u0131lmaz ile ba\u015flar, I am writing to ask whether\u2026 ile amac\u0131 s\xf6yler, I would be grateful if you could\u2026 ile rica eder, Kind regards ya da Best regards ile kapan\u0131r. Unvan kullan\u0131m\u0131 T\xfcrk\xe7eden farkl\u0131d\u0131r: Professor her zaman soyadla gelir, Dear Professor Ahmet yanl\u0131\u015ft\u0131r; hocan\u0131n unvan\u0131ndan emin de\u011filsen doktoral\u0131 bir hoca i\xe7in Dear Dr Y\u0131lmaz en g\xfcvenli se\xe7imdir; Professor ABD'de her \xf6\u011fretim \xfcyesi i\xe7in genel hitap olarak kabul g\xf6r\xfcr, \u0130ngiltere'de ise yaln\u0131zca profes\xf6r kadrosundakilerin unvan\u0131d\u0131r. S\xfcre uzatma, randevu ya da referans mektubu isterken gerek\xe7eyi k\u0131sa tut, kendine ac\u0131nd\u0131rma ve kar\u015f\u0131 tarafa karar pay\u0131 b\u0131rak: Would it be possible to submit the paper on Monday instead? gibi. E-postan\u0131n konu sat\u0131r\u0131 da akademik kayda dahildir: Question yerine Extension request for ENG 201 term paper yazarsan hoca mesaj\u0131 a\xe7madan ne istedi\u011fini bilir.")
B.ba9=s([B.aZe,B.aRx,B.b1w],t.q)
B.atv=new A.p("The findings suggest that the intervention had a modest effect.","Bulgular, m\xfcdahalenin \xf6l\xe7\xfcl\xfc bir etkisi oldu\u011funu g\xf6steriyor.","suggest + modest: akademik y\xfcklem abartmaz",null)
B.aFi=new A.p("The sharp rise in unemployment between 2008 and 2010 is well documented.","2008 ile 2010 aras\u0131ndaki keskin i\u015fsizlik art\u0131\u015f\u0131 iyi belgelenmi\u015ftir.","Nominalle\u015ftirme: unemployment rose sharply \u2192 the sharp rise",null)
B.aGG=new A.p("We investigated three possible causes of the discrepancy.","Tutars\u0131zl\u0131\u011f\u0131n \xfc\xe7 olas\u0131 nedenini ara\u015ft\u0131rd\u0131k.","investigate; look into konu\u015fma dilinde kal\u0131r",null)
B.aBS=new A.p("The sample size was limited; consequently, the results should be interpreted with caution.","\xd6rneklem s\u0131n\u0131rl\u0131yd\u0131; bu nedenle sonu\xe7lar dikkatle yorumlanmal\u0131d\u0131r.","K\u0131s\u0131t\u0131 kendin s\xf6yle: interpret with caution kal\u0131b\u0131",null)
B.aFv=new A.p("Dear Professor Y\u0131lmaz, I am writing to ask whether the deadline for the term paper could be extended.","Say\u0131n Profes\xf6r Y\u0131lmaz, d\xf6nem \xf6devinin teslim tarihinin uzat\u0131labilece\u011fini sormak i\xe7in yaz\u0131yorum.","Hocaya e-posta: unvan + soyad\u0131, ama\xe7 ilk c\xfcmlede",null)
B.aB3=new A.p("I would be grateful if you could let me know by Friday.","Cumaya kadar bana bildirebilirseniz \xe7ok memnun olurum.","Resm\xee rica: I would be grateful if you could\u2026",null)
B.ate=new A.p("Approximately 40 per cent of respondents reported the same difficulty.","Kat\u0131l\u0131mc\u0131lar\u0131n yakla\u015f\u0131k y\xfczde 40'\u0131 ayn\u0131 g\xfc\xe7l\xfc\u011f\xfc bildirdi.","approximately; about ve around g\xfcnl\xfck kay\u0131tta",null)
B.aEU=new A.p("This study does not attempt to explain why the pattern varies across regions.","Bu \xe7al\u0131\u015fma, \xf6r\xfcnt\xfcn\xfcn b\xf6lgeler aras\u0131nda neden de\u011fi\u015fti\u011fini a\xe7\u0131klamay\u0131 ama\xe7lamamaktad\u0131r.","Kapsam s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131: neyi yapmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 da yazars\u0131n",null)
B.b4g=s([B.atv,B.aFi,B.aGG,B.aBS,B.aFv,B.aB3,B.ate,B.aEU],t.W)
B.aMi=new A.O("I think smoking is very bad and everybody knows it.","There is considerable evidence that smoking has adverse health effects.","Akademik metinde ki\u015fisel sezgi ve herkes bilir genellemesi kan\u0131t say\u0131lmaz; iddia bir kan\u0131t kayna\u011f\u0131na ba\u011flan\u0131r ve very bad yerine \xf6l\xe7\xfc bildiren bir ifade kullan\u0131l\u0131r.",null)
B.aKT=new A.O("Hey Professor Ahmet, can u give me extra time for the homework?","Dear Professor Y\u0131lmaz, I am writing to ask whether an extension would be possible.","Professor unvan\u0131 yaln\u0131zca soyadla kullan\u0131l\u0131r, u gibi k\u0131saltmalar ve Hey hitab\u0131 akademik yaz\u0131\u015fmada kabul edilmez; rica dolayl\u0131 kal\u0131pla kurulur.",null)
B.aOX=new A.O("The government didn't do anything about this thing.","The government took no action on the issue.","Akademik kay\u0131t k\u0131saltma kullanmaz (didn't yerine did not) ve thing gibi belirsiz isimler yerine issue, factor, phenomenon gibi kesin isimler ister.",null)
B.aKo=new A.O("A lot of researches were done about this topic.","A considerable body of research has addressed this issue.","research say\u0131lamayan bir isimdir ve \xe7o\u011ful olmaz; a lot of konu\u015fma kayd\u0131d\u0131r, ayr\u0131ca yap\u0131lan ara\u015ft\u0131rmadan s\xf6z ederken address an issue e\u015fdizimi failsiz edilgenden daha bilgilendiricidir.",null)
