B.ax6=new A.p("While this explanation accounts for the 2008 data, it cannot explain the later divergence.","Bu a\xe7\u0131klama 2008 verilerini kar\u015f\u0131lasa da sonraki ayr\u0131\u015fmay\u0131 a\xe7\u0131klayam\u0131yor.","\xd6d\xfcn + s\u0131n\u0131r: en g\xfc\xe7l\xfc ele\u015ftiri yap\u0131s\u0131",null)
B.awS=new A.p("Arguably, the most serious weakness is the way engagement was operationalised.","En ciddi zay\u0131fl\u0131\u011f\u0131n, kat\u0131l\u0131m\u0131n nas\u0131l i\u015fletimselle\u015ftirildi\u011fi oldu\u011fu savunulabilir.","arguably: tart\u0131\u015fmaya a\xe7\u0131k ama savunulabilir iddia",null)
B.avr=new A.p("This interpretation rests on the assumption that the samples are comparable.","Bu yorum, \xf6rneklemlerin kar\u015f\u0131la\u015ft\u0131r\u0131labilir oldu\u011fu varsay\u0131m\u0131na dayan\u0131yor.","Varsay\u0131m\u0131 adland\u0131rmak ele\u015ftirinin \xf6z\xfcd\xfcr",null)
