B.aM8=new A.O("I made a research about migration policy.","I carried out research on migration policy.","research say\u0131lamayan bir isimdir ve make fiiliyle gelmez; do\u011fru e\u015fdizimler conduct research ve carry out research't\xfcr, konu ise on edat\u0131yla ba\u011flan\u0131r.",null)
B.aR9=new A.O("She is an academician in the physics department.","She is an academic in the physics department.","academician \u0130ngilizcede bir akademi ya da enstit\xfc \xfcyesi anlam\u0131na gelir; \xfcniversitede \xe7al\u0131\u015fan \xf6\u011fretim eleman\u0131 an academic, a researcher ya da a lecturer olarak kar\u015f\u0131lan\u0131r.",null)
B.aJA=new A.O("The results were very actual and important for policy.","The results are highly relevant to current policy debates.","actual ger\xe7ek demektir, g\xfcncel demek de\u011fil; g\xfcncellik i\xe7in current ya da up to date, \xf6nem i\xe7in relevant to kullan\u0131l\u0131r.",null)
B.aOb=new A.O("This is a very sympathetic approach to the problem.","This is an appealing approach to the problem.","sympathetic anlay\u0131\u015fl\u0131 ve destekleyici anlam\u0131ndad\u0131r, sevimli de\u011fil; bir yakla\u015f\u0131m\u0131 olumlu nitelemek i\xe7in appealing, promising ya da elegant kullan\u0131l\u0131r.",null)
