B.c5A=new A.bw("a-10-academic-vocab-1000","Bin akademik kelime: aile, e\u015fdizim ve disiplin terimleri","Bu mihenk ad\u0131m\u0131nda akademik kelime da\u011farc\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 bin kelimeye \xe7\u0131kar\u0131yorsun: AWL'nin 570 kelime ailesi art\u0131 kendi alan\u0131n\u0131n terimleri. Bu \xf6l\xe7ekte tek tek kelime ezberlemek \xe7\xf6ker; verimli yol aile \xf6\u011frenmektir (analyse / analysis / analytical / analytically) \xe7\xfcnk\xfc akademik yaz\u0131da ayn\u0131 k\xf6k\xfc farkl\u0131 s\xf6zc\xfck t\xfcr\xfcnde kullanman gerekir. \u0130kinci yar\u0131s\u0131 e\u015fdizim ve yalanc\u0131 e\u015f dostlard\u0131r: conduct research, pose a question, draw a conclusion, address an issue kal\u0131plar\u0131; actual, eventually, sensible, comprehensive gibi anlam\u0131 kolayca yanl\u0131\u015f tahmin edilen kelimeler. Hedef tan\u0131ma de\u011fil \xfcretim: kelimeyi k\u0131rk sekiz saat i\xe7inde kendi c\xfcmlende kullanmad\u0131ysan \xf6\u011frenmemi\u015f say\u0131l\u0131rs\u0131n.",B.bAe,B.b8e,B.b7O,"Kelime tekrar\u0131 b\xf6l\xfcm\xfcnde akademik kelime paketinin tamam\u0131n\u0131 alt liste s\u0131ras\u0131yla \xe7al\u0131\u015f: g\xfcnde yirmi yeni kart, her kartta kelime ailesi (analyse / analysis / analytical), bir e\u015fdizim (draw a conclusion) ve kendi alan\u0131ndan bir c\xfcmle; vurgusu kayan kelimeleri (analysis, political, photography) sesli tekrar et. Peki\u015fen kelimelerde write ve cloze modlar\u0131n\u0131 kullan ki tan\u0131ma de\u011fil \xfcretim \xf6l\xe7. Paralelde kendi okudu\u011fun \xfc\xe7 makaleden ki\u015fisel bir terim s\xf6zl\xfc\u011f\xfc \xe7\u0131kar (terim, tan\u0131m, tipik kullan\u0131m) ve ayr\u0131 bir sayfada yalanc\u0131 e\u015f dostlar\u0131 do\u011fru-yanl\u0131\u015f \xe7ifti h\xe2linde listele (actual, eventually, sensible, comprehensive, sympathetic, academician, pretend). Her yeni kelimeyi k\u0131rk sekiz saat i\xe7inde bir Essay metninde ya da bir Sunum kayd\u0131nda kendi c\xfcmlenle \xfcret.",B.j,null,null,null,null)
