B.c7E=new A.bv("so-11-improv-social",B.dW,B.aj,11,"Do\u011fa\xe7lama: sohbeti ayakta tut","Pratik > Do\u011fa\xe7lama: sosyal sahneleri se\xe7 (ad\u0131n\u0131 unuttu\u011fun ki\u015fi, geri \xe7evirece\u011fin davet, gerilen masa) \u2014 kopyalanacak metin yok, hemen konu\u015fursun. 3 sahneyi en fazla 1 kez anla\u015f\u0131lmadan bitir.","Improv: keep the conversation going","Practice > Improv: pick the social scenes (a name you forgot, an invitation you must turn down, a tense dinner table) \u2014 nothing to copy, you start speaking straight away. Finish 3 scenes with at most 1 misunderstanding.",B.AF,B.c_B,"\ud83c\udfad",35)
