B.aTE=new A.r("Kelimeyi tabelas\u0131yla ve anonsla \xf6\u011fren","Havaalan\u0131 kelimeleri \xfc\xe7 yerde kar\u015f\u0131na \xe7\u0131kar: tabelada, ekranda ve anonsta. Ayn\u0131 kelime \xfc\xe7\xfcnde farkl\u0131 bi\xe7imde g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcr, bu y\xfczden kart\u0131n\u0131 \xfc\xe7 bi\xe7imle birlikte yaz. Tabela kelimeleri k\u0131sad\u0131r: Departures (gidi\u015f), Arrivals (var\u0131\u015f), Baggage reclaim ya da Baggage claim (bagaj teslim), Customs (g\xfcmr\xfck), Border control ya da Passport control, Transfers (aktarma), Left luggage (emanet). Ekran kelimeleri durum bildirir: On time, Delayed, Boarding, Gate closing, Final call, Cancelled, Gate change. Bu yedi kelime u\xe7u\u015fun tamam\u0131n\u0131 y\xf6netir. Anonslarda c\xfcmleler bloklar h\xe2linde gelir: This is the final call for passengers travelling to Amsterdam, gate B24 is now closing. Blok tan\u0131nd\u0131\u011f\u0131nda ayr\u0131nt\u0131 otomatik anla\u015f\u0131l\u0131r. Kelimeler aras\u0131ndaki fark\u0131 \xf6\u011frenmek zorunludur: layover ya da stopover aktarma beklemesi, connecting flight ba\u011flant\u0131 u\xe7u\u015fu, transit ise \xfclkeye girmeden ge\xe7i\u015ftir.")
B.b1u=new A.r("Say\u0131lar, saatler ve fiyatlar: duydu\u011funu do\u011frula","Havaalan\u0131nda say\u0131 bir bilgi de\u011fil bir talimatt\u0131r; yanl\u0131\u015f duyulan tek hane yanl\u0131\u015f kap\u0131ya gitmek demektir. Bu y\xfczden duydu\u011fun say\u0131y\u0131 tekrar etmek standart davran\u0131\u015ft\u0131r. Kap\u0131 ve koltuk numaralar\u0131 harf ve rakam olarak tek tek okunur: gate B24 (bi-twenty-four), seat 23F (twenty-three F). Harfler kar\u0131\u015f\u0131yorsa NATO alfabesi kullan\u0131l\u0131r: B for Bravo, F for Foxtrot. Saat iki bi\xe7imde s\xf6ylenir: half past ten ve ten thirty ayn\u0131 \u015feydir; ekranlar yirmi d\xf6rt saatlik bi\xe7imde yazar (14:40), ama konu\u015fmada bu saat genellikle twenty to three ya da two forty olur. Baz\u0131 anonslarda, \xf6zellikle Britanya ve Avrupa'da, yirmi d\xf6rt saatlik okunu\u015f da duyulur (fourteen forty); Amerika'da ise on iki saatlik bi\xe7im yayg\u0131nd\u0131r. Fiyatlarda para birimi ve kuru\u015f bi\xe7imi \xf6nemlidir: forty-five ninety-nine dendi\u011finde 45,99 demektir; ayr\u0131ca each, per bag, per person ve return ile one-way ayr\u0131m\u0131 fiyat\u0131 tamamen de\u011fi\u015ftirir. Do\u011frulama kal\u0131b\u0131n\u0131 ezberle: Sorry, did you say gate B24? ve Let me just repeat that back to you. Bu iki c\xfcmle seyahatte en \xe7ok i\u015fe yarayan c\xfcmlelerdendir.")
B.aUQ=new A.r("\xc7al\u0131\u015fma y\xf6ntemi: sahne sahne, sesli","Kelimeleri alfabetik de\u011fil sahneye g\xf6re grupla: check-in, g\xfcvenlik, pasaport, kap\u0131, u\xe7ak i\xe7i, bagaj, g\xfcmr\xfck. Beyin listeyi de\u011fil sahneyi hat\u0131rlar. Her kelimenin yan\u0131na o sahnede sana sorulacak soruyu yaz: bagaj kelimelerinin yan\u0131na Any bags to check in?, g\xfcvenlik kelimelerinin yan\u0131na Do you have any liquids? Kelimeleri sesli \xe7al\u0131\u015f, \xe7\xfcnk\xfc havaalan\u0131nda okuma de\u011fil dinleme s\u0131nav\u0131na gireceksin; \xf6zellikle aisle (ayl, s okunmaz), queue (kyu), lounge ve receipt (risit) gibi telaffuzu \u015fa\u015f\u0131rtan kelimeleri tekrar et. Say\u0131 \xe7al\u0131\u015fmas\u0131n\u0131 ayr\u0131 yap: kendine rastgele kap\u0131, koltuk, saat ve fiyat s\xf6yleyip yazmay\u0131 dene; dinleyip yazma al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rmas\u0131 bu ad\u0131mda kelime kart\u0131ndan daha de\u011ferlidir. Her kelimeyi k\u0131rk sekiz saat i\xe7inde bir Roleplay sahnesinde sesli kullan; tan\u0131d\u0131\u011f\u0131n ama s\xf6ylemedi\u011fin kelime havaalan\u0131nda i\u015fine yaramaz.")
B.bam=s([B.aTE,B.b1u,B.aUQ],t.q)
B.asM=new A.p("Is this the queue for baggage drop-off?","Bagaj b\u0131rakma s\u0131ras\u0131 bu mu?","queue: kyu okunur; drop-off bagaj\u0131 teslim etme",null)
B.atf=new A.p("My connecting flight leaves from Terminal 2.","Ba\u011flant\u0131 u\xe7u\u015fum 2. Terminal'den kalk\u0131yor.","connecting flight: ba\u011flant\u0131; layover bekleme s\xfcresi",null)
