B.aJD=new A.O("The air conditioning doesn't work since two days.","The air conditioning hasn't been working for two days.","S\xfcre i\xe7in for kullan\u0131l\u0131r, since ise ba\u015flang\u0131\xe7 noktas\u0131 ister; ayr\u0131ca h\xe2l\xe2 devam eden bir sorun present perfect continuous (hasn't been working) ile anlat\u0131l\u0131r ve bu yap\u0131 \u015fik\xe2yeti daha ciddi g\xf6sterir.",null)
