B.aMt=new A.O("I want to go to the museum. Where is it? Tell me the way.","Excuse me, could you tell me how to get to the museum?","Emir kipiyle kurulan istek yard\u0131m alma \u015fans\u0131n\u0131 d\xfc\u015f\xfcr\xfcr; yol sorma her zaman bir \xf6z\xfcr kal\u0131b\u0131yla a\xe7\u0131l\u0131r ve soru bi\xe7iminde sorulur.",null)
