B.aKF=new A.O("Okay, thanks!","So, second right after the bank \u2014 thanks, that's really helpful.","Tarifi dinleyip yaln\u0131zca Okay, thanks! deyip y\xfcr\xfcmek, tarifi hi\xe7 do\u011frulamamak demektir; y\xf6n tarifleri h\u0131zl\u0131 ve yerel deyimlerle verilir, do\u011frulama yap\u0131lmad\u0131\u011f\u0131nda tarifi yanl\u0131\u015f hat\u0131rlama olas\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131 y\xfcksektir ve \xf6zetleme c\xfcmlesi kar\u015f\u0131 tarafa da d\xfczeltme \u015fans\u0131 verir.",null)
