B.aOD=new A.O("I don't eat nuts, I don't like them so much.","I'm allergic to nuts \u2014 could you check with the kitchen?","Alerjiyi tercih gibi anlatmak mutfakta \xf6nlem al\u0131nmamas\u0131na yol a\xe7ar; alerji her zaman allergic to kal\u0131b\u0131yla ve ciddiyet belirtilerek s\xf6ylenir.",null)
