B.aRZ=new A.r("Zaman de\u011fil, bak\u0131\u015f a\xe7\u0131s\u0131 se\xe7iyorsun","Present perfect ge\xe7mi\u015fteki bir olay\u0131 anlatmaz; o olay\u0131n bug\xfcne b\u0131rakt\u0131\u011f\u0131 sonucu anlat\u0131r. 'I've lost my keys' dedi\u011finde odak anahtar\u0131 ne zaman kaybetti\u011fin de\u011fil, \u015fu anda anahtars\u0131z olmand\u0131r. Ayn\u0131 olay\u0131 'I lost my keys yesterday' dersen art\u0131k bitmi\u015f, kapanm\u0131\u015f bir hik\xe2ye anlat\u0131rs\u0131n ve dinleyici bug\xfcnle ilgilenmez. Bu y\xfczden c\xfcmleyi kurmadan \xf6nce kendine tek soru sor: dinleyene tarih mi veriyorum, yoksa \u015fu anki durumu mu bildiriyorum. T\xfcrk\xe7ede 'anahtar\u0131m\u0131 kaybettim' c\xfcmlesi iki anlam\u0131 da ta\u015f\u0131r, \u0130ngilizcede ise se\xe7im yapmak zorundas\u0131n.")
B.aVc=new A.r("Belirli zaman zarf\u0131 varsa past simple kazan\u0131r","yesterday, last week, in 2019, two hours ago, when I was a child gibi bitmi\u015f bir zaman s\xf6ylendi\u011fi anda present perfect kapan\u0131r. Bu y\xfczden 'I have seen him yesterday' hem kula\u011fa yanl\u0131\u015f gelir hem de mant\u0131ks\u0131zd\u0131r: hem bitmi\u015f zaman\u0131 hem bug\xfcne ba\u011flant\u0131y\u0131 ayn\u0131 anda iddia eder. Buna kar\u015f\u0131l\u0131k today, this week, this year gibi h\xe2l\xe2 devam eden zaman dilimleri present perfect ile gayet do\u011fald\u0131r: 'I've had three coffees today.' Konu\u015fmalarda \xe7ok yayg\u0131n bir \xf6r\xfcnt\xfc vard\u0131r: haberi present perfect ile a\xe7ars\u0131n, detaylar\u0131 past simple ile verirsin. 'I've just talked to the landlord. He said the rent is going up.' \u2014 a\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015f bug\xfcne ba\u011flan\u0131r, devam\u0131 ge\xe7mi\u015fe d\xfc\u015fer.")
B.aYL=new A.r("since ve for: ba\u015flang\u0131\xe7 noktas\u0131 m\u0131, s\xfcre mi","since bir ba\u015flang\u0131\xe7 noktas\u0131 al\u0131r (since 2019, since Monday, since I moved here), for ise bir s\xfcre al\u0131r (for three years, for ten minutes). T\xfcrk\xe7ede ikisi de 'beri' ya da 'dir' ekiyle kar\u015f\u0131land\u0131\u011f\u0131 i\xe7in 'since three years' hatas\u0131 neredeyse otomatik gelir; oysa \xfc\xe7 y\u0131l bir tarih de\u011fil, bir uzunluktur. Devam eden durumlarda present perfect zorunludur: 'I have lived in Izmir for three years' h\xe2l\xe2 orada ya\u015fad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 s\xf6yler. Ayn\u0131 c\xfcmleyi 'I am living here since 2019' diye kurmak \u0130ngilizcede m\xfcmk\xfcn de\u011fildir, \xe7\xfcnk\xfc present continuous ge\xe7mi\u015fe uzanamaz. Eylemin kendisini ve s\xfcreklili\u011fini vurgulamak istersen present perfect continuous devreye girer: 'I've been working on this all morning.'")
B.aW7=new A.r("Ba\u011fl\u0131 konu\u015fmada duyulan h\xe2li","G\xfcnl\xfck konu\u015fmada have/has neredeyse hi\xe7 tam okunmaz: I have k\u0131sal\u0131p 'I've', he has k\u0131sal\u0131p 'he's', we have k\u0131sal\u0131p 'we've' olur. Bu y\xfczden 'he's seen it' c\xfcmlesini duydu\u011funda bunun 'he is' de\u011fil 'he has' oldu\u011funu ancak arkas\u0131ndaki \xfc\xe7\xfcnc\xfc h\xe2lden (seen) anlars\u0131n. Olumsuzda da ayn\u0131 s\u0131k\u0131\u015fma vard\u0131r: haven't 'h\xe6vnt', hasn't 'h\xe6znt' gibi tek nefeste \xe7\u0131kar. K\u0131saltmay\u0131 a\xe7arak konu\u015fmak dilbilgisi hatas\u0131 de\u011fildir ama resmi ve yava\u015f duyulur; do\u011fal ritim k\u0131saltmayla gelir. Dinlerken bu k\u0131salmay\u0131 ka\xe7\u0131r\u0131rsan c\xfcmlenin zaman\u0131n\u0131 tamamen yanl\u0131\u015f anlars\u0131n, bu y\xfczden shadowing s\u0131ras\u0131nda \xf6zellikle bu iki sese dikkat et.")
B.bzC=s([B.aRZ,B.aVc,B.aYL,B.aW7],t.q)
B.aAu=new A.p("I've lived in Izmir for three years.","\xdc\xe7 y\u0131ld\u0131r \u0130zmir'de ya\u015f\u0131yorum.","S\xfcre i\xe7in for; durum h\xe2l\xe2 devam ediyor",null)
B.aBE=new A.p("I've lived in Izmir since 2022.","2022'den beri \u0130zmir'de ya\u015f\u0131yorum.","Ba\u015flang\u0131\xe7 noktas\u0131 i\xe7in since",null)
B.aEA=new A.p("Have you ever tried Japanese food?","Hi\xe7 Japon yeme\u011fi denedin mi?","Hayat deneyimi sorusu, tarih sorulmuyor",null)
B.axy=new A.p("Yeah, I tried it in Berlin last year.","Evet, ge\xe7en y\u0131l Berlin'de denedim.","Tarih gelince past simple'a ge\xe7ilir",null)
B.auz=new A.p("I've just finished the report.","Raporu az \xf6nce bitirdim.","just, already, yet present perfect ile gelir",null)
