B.aMV=new A.O("I work here since three years.","I've worked here for three years.","\xdc\xe7 y\u0131l bir ba\u015flang\u0131\xe7 noktas\u0131 de\u011fil s\xfcredir; s\xfcre for ile gelir, since yaln\u0131zca tarih ya da olay al\u0131r. Ayr\u0131ca h\xe2l\xe2 s\xfcren bir durum geni\u015f zamanla de\u011fil present perfect ile anlat\u0131l\u0131r, bu y\xfczden work da have worked olur.",null)
B.aKe=new A.O("I have went to London twice.","I've been to London twice.","Present perfect \xfc\xe7\xfcnc\xfc h\xe2l ister; ayr\u0131ca gidip d\xf6nm\xfc\u015f olmay\u0131 anlatmak i\xe7in go de\u011fil be fiilinin been h\xe2li kullan\u0131l\u0131r.",null)
