B.aPZ=new A.O("You must to finish it today.","You must finish it today.","Modallerden sonra to gelmez; yaln\u0131zca have to ve ought to yap\u0131lar\u0131nda to kal\u0131b\u0131n par\xe7as\u0131d\u0131r.",null)
B.aPw=new A.O("You mustn't bring your laptop, we have spares.","You don't have to bring your laptop, we have spares.","mustn't yasak demektir; gereksizlik anlatmak i\xe7in don't have to kullan\u0131l\u0131r.",null)
B.aKQ=new A.O("Maybe he can be at the office now.","He might be at the office now.","can yetenek ve izin bildirir, anl\u0131k tahmin i\xe7in might ya da could gerekir; might ihtimali zaten ta\u015f\u0131d\u0131\u011f\u0131 i\xe7in maybe'ye de gerek kalmaz.",null)
B.aKq=new A.O("She cans speak three languages.","She can speak three languages.","Modaller \xfc\xe7\xfcnc\xfc tekilde -s almaz ve kendilerinden sonraki fiili de yal\u0131n b\u0131rak\u0131r.",null)
