B.aR6=new A.O("I. WAS. GOING. TO. CALL. YOU.","I was gonna CALL you.","Yanl\u0131\u015f h\xe2lde her kelime e\u015fit vurguyla tek tek s\xf6ylenir; do\u011frusunda ana vurgu yaln\u0131zca call \xfczerindedir. Do\u011frusundaki gonna da do\u011fal konu\u015fman\u0131n par\xe7as\u0131d\u0131r (going to'yu tam s\xf6ylemek hata de\u011fildir); as\u0131l hata her kelimeyi e\u015fit vurgulamakt\u0131r. \u0130ngilizce vurgu zamanl\u0131 bir dildir; her kelimeyi e\u015fit okumak c\xfcmleyi hem robotik hem anla\u015f\u0131lmaz yapar.",null)
