B.aMD=new A.O("I very like this film.","I really like this film.","very bir fiili niteleyemez; fiili g\xfc\xe7lendirmek i\xe7in really ya da c\xfcmle sonunda a lot kullan\u0131l\u0131r.",null)
B.aOT=new A.O("She speaks very well English.","She speaks English very well.","Tarz zarf\u0131 fiil ile nesnesinin aras\u0131na giremez, nesneden sonra gelir.",null)
