B.aTj=new A.r("S\xf6z al, ilk c\xfcmlede duru\u015funu s\xf6yle","Toplant\u0131da s\u0131ra kendili\u011finden gelmez; al\u0131n\u0131r. Bunu yapan kal\u0131plar k\u0131sad\u0131r: Can I jump in here? \u2014 Sorry to cut in \u2014 Before we move on, can I add one thing? Uzun bir izin c\xfcmlesi (Excuse me, sorry, if it is possible, maybe I want to say\u2026) s\u0131ray\u0131 almaz, sadece dikkati da\u011f\u0131t\u0131r ve kar\u015f\u0131 taraf araya tekrar girer. S\xf6z\xfc ald\u0131ktan sonraki ilk c\xfcmle pozisyonunu s\xf6ylemeli, arka plan\u0131 de\u011fil: I'd move the date rather than cut the scope. Gerek\xe7e hemen ard\u0131ndan gelir. T\xfcrk\xe7e konu\u015fanlar\u0131n en s\u0131k hatas\u0131 \xf6nce ba\u011flam anlat\u0131p sonuca en sonda varmakt\u0131r; \u0130ngilizce i\u015f konu\u015fmas\u0131nda sonu\xe7 ba\u015fa, gerek\xe7e sona gider. K\xf6t\xfc haberde de s\u0131ra ayn\u0131d\u0131r; \xf6nce haber, sonra sebep, en son plan gelir: We'll miss Friday's deadline \u2014 half the data is still missing, but we can have the report ready by Tuesday. Haberi uzun bir giri\u015fin arkas\u0131na saklamak onu yumu\u015fatmaz, yaln\u0131zca geciktirir. \u0130ki k\u0131sa c\xfcmle, bir uzun ve yar\u0131m kalm\u0131\u015f c\xfcmleden her zaman daha g\xfc\xe7l\xfcd\xfcr \u2014 haz\u0131rl\u0131ks\u0131zken uzun c\xfcmle kurmaya \xe7al\u0131\u015fmak donman\u0131n en yayg\u0131n sebebidir.")
B.b1f=new A.r("Beklenmedik soru: \xe7er\xe7evele, s\u0131n\u0131rla, s\xf6z ver","Haz\u0131rl\u0131ks\u0131z bir soruda en pahal\u0131 hamle hemen cevaplamakt\u0131r; en ucuzu ise cevab\u0131 \xe7er\xe7evelemektir: That's a good question \u2014 let me take that in two parts. \xc7er\xe7eveleme hem sana saniye kazand\u0131r\u0131r hem kar\u015f\u0131 tarafa cevab\u0131n haritas\u0131n\u0131 verir; ard\u0131ndan iki par\xe7ay\u0131 s\u0131rayla s\xf6ylersin ve da\u011f\u0131lmazs\u0131n. Bilmedi\u011fin bir say\u0131 soruldu\u011funda uydurma; bilgiyi s\u0131n\u0131rla ve takip s\xf6z\xfc ver: I don't have that figure with me \u2014 I'll send it by the end of the day. K\u0131smi bilgi varsa i\u015faretleyerek ver: off the top of my head it's under ten per cent, but I'd rather check. Toplant\u0131da uydurulan rakam bir sonraki toplant\u0131da d\xfczeltilir ve g\xfcveni kal\u0131c\u0131 bi\xe7imde d\xfc\u015f\xfcr\xfcr. Soru \xe7ok geni\u015fse daraltmak senin hakk\u0131nd\u0131r: Do you mean this quarter or the whole year? Yanl\u0131\u015f soruya verilen uzun cevap, k\u0131sa bir bilmiyorum cevab\u0131ndan daha zararl\u0131d\u0131r.")
B.aZl=new A.r("\u0130tiraz: kabul et, gerek\xe7elendir, \xf6neri b\u0131rak","\u0130tiraz sald\u0131r\u0131 de\u011fil bilgi talebidir; savunmaya ge\xe7mek onu \xe7at\u0131\u015fmaya \xe7evirir. \xdc\xe7 ad\u0131ml\u0131 kal\u0131p i\u015fi bitirir: ge\xe7erli k\u0131sm\u0131 kabul et, gerek\xe7eni ver, somut bir \xf6neri b\u0131rak. Kabul k\u0131sa olur: That's a fair point ya da You're right that the timing is tight. Kar\u015f\u0131 taraf\u0131n hakl\u0131 oldu\u011fu yeri s\xf6ylemek seni zay\u0131f de\u011fil g\xfcvenilir g\xf6sterir. Gerek\xe7e tek c\xfcmle ve somut olmal\u0131: The reason we chose the slower option is the audit in March. Gerek\xe7esiz bir hay\u0131r tart\u0131\u015fmay\u0131 kapatmaz, sadece erteler. \xd6neri tart\u0131\u015fmay\u0131 ileri ta\u015f\u0131r: How about we try it for two sprints and review the numbers? B\xf6ylece konu\u015fma kim hakl\u0131 sorusundan ne yapal\u0131m sorusuna ge\xe7er. Tart\u0131\u015fma uzuyor ve toplant\u0131y\u0131 yiyorsa ertelemek me\u015frudur: Let's circle back to this after the call. Bu c\xfcmle ka\xe7\u0131\u015f de\u011fil, g\xfcndemi koruma hamlesidir.")
B.aXg=new A.r("Anla\u015f\u0131lmad\u0131\u011f\u0131nda: onar, tekrarlama","Kar\u015f\u0131ndaki Sorry? dedi\u011finde ayn\u0131 c\xfcmleyi daha yava\u015f ya da kelime kelime tekrarlamak i\u015fe yaramaz \u2014 \xe7\xfcnk\xfc sorun h\u0131z de\u011fil yap\u0131d\u0131r. \xdc\xe7 hamle i\u015fe yarar: c\xfcmleyi k\u0131salt, terimi de\u011fi\u015ftir, ya da somut bir say\u0131 veya \xf6rnek ver. Let me put that another way ve What I mean is bu hamleleri a\xe7an kal\u0131plard\u0131r. Ters y\xf6nde de onar\u0131m vard\u0131r: sen anlamad\u0131ysan teyit et. Just to make sure I understood \u2014 you're asking about the budget, not the timeline? Anlamadan onaylamak (yes, yes, sure) i\u015f ba\u011flam\u0131nda en pahal\u0131 al\u0131\u015fkanl\u0131kt\u0131r; yanl\u0131\u015f anlad\u0131\u011f\u0131n bir g\xf6revi kabul etmi\u015f olursun ve bunu ancak teslimde fark edersin. Rapor ka\xe7 kez anla\u015f\u0131lmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 g\xf6sterir; bu say\u0131 seni cezaland\u0131rmaz, hangi c\xfcmle yap\u0131s\u0131n\u0131n \xe7\xf6kt\xfc\u011f\xfcn\xfc g\xf6sterir ve pratikle d\xfc\u015fer.")
