B.azk=new A.p("That's a fair point, and the reason we chose the slower option is the audit.","Hakl\u0131 bir nokta; daha yava\u015f se\xe7ene\u011fi tercih etmemizin sebebi denetim.","\xd6nce kabul, sonra gerek\xe7e: itiraz\u0131 \xe7at\u0131\u015fmaya \xe7evirmez",null)
