B.aIN=new A.p("Let me put that another way: we'll be late, but we'll deliver everything.","Ba\u015fka t\xfcrl\xfc s\xf6yleyeyim: ge\xe7 kalaca\u011f\u0131z ama eksiksiz teslim edece\u011fiz.","Anla\u015f\u0131lmay\u0131nca tekrarlama; k\u0131salt ve yeniden kur",null)
B.bhT=s([B.aFt,B.awL,B.aGZ,B.atH,B.azk,B.aIU,B.aCV,B.aIN],t.W)
B.aLN=new A.O("Excuse me, sorry, if it is possible maybe I want to say one thing about the topic which we discussed it before.","Can I jump in here? I'd move the date, not cut the scope.","Uzun izin c\xfcmlesi s\u0131ray\u0131 almaz, sadece dikkati da\u011f\u0131t\u0131r; s\xf6z alma k\u0131sa olur ve hemen duru\u015fla devam eder. Ayr\u0131ca which we discussed it before'daki it fazlad\u0131r: which nesneyi zaten kar\u015f\u0131lar, do\u011frusu the topic we discussed before.",null)
B.aK9=new A.O("Our churn is around twelve per cent.","I don't have the churn number with me \u2014 I'll follow up after the call.","Rakam\u0131 bilmeden around twelve per cent gibi bir say\u0131 s\xf6ylemek tuzakt\u0131r: toplant\u0131da uydurulan rakam bir sonraki toplant\u0131da d\xfczeltilir; bilgiyi s\u0131n\u0131rlay\u0131p takip s\xf6z\xfc vermek hem d\xfcr\xfcst hem profesyonel davran\u0131\u015ft\u0131r.",null)
B.aKp=new A.O("No, you don't understand our process.","That's a fair point \u2014 let me explain why we do it this way.","\u0130tiraz\u0131 reddetmek tart\u0131\u015fmay\u0131 ki\u015fiselle\u015ftirir; ge\xe7erli k\u0131sm\u0131 kabul edip gerek\xe7e vermek hem nazik hem daha ikna edicidir.",null)
B.aQH=new A.O("Like I said, the delay that we have been talking about since the start of the meeting is not caused by the client but by us.","Sorry, let me put that another way \u2014 the delay is on our side, not the client's.","Kar\u015f\u0131ndaki Sorry? dedi\u011finde Like I said deyip ayn\u0131 uzun c\xfcmleyi kelime kelime tekrarlamak i\u015fe yaramaz; anla\u015f\u0131lmama sebebi h\u0131z de\u011fil yap\u0131d\u0131r. Let me put that another way ile c\xfcmleyi k\u0131salt\u0131p sonucu ba\u015fa almak ya da somut bir \xf6rnek vermek tekrar etmekten her zaman daha iyi sonu\xe7 verir.",null)
B.aM1=new A.O("Yes, yes, sure.","Sorry, I didn't catch that \u2014 which team is sending the report?","G\xf6revi anlamadan yes, yes, sure diye onaylamak i\u015f ba\u011flam\u0131nda yanl\u0131\u015f g\xf6revi \xfcstlenmek demektir ve hata ancak teslim an\u0131nda ortaya \xe7\u0131kar; ka\xe7\u0131rd\u0131\u011f\u0131n k\u0131sm\u0131 hemen sormak bunu ba\u015ftan \xf6nler.",null)
