B.c6P=new A.bw("b-11-improv-business","Do\u011fa\xe7lama: toplant\u0131da haz\u0131rl\u0131ks\u0131z konu\u015fmak","E-postay\u0131 yazarken d\xfczeltirsin, sunumu \xf6nceden kurars\u0131n; ama toplant\u0131da s\xf6z sana beklenmedik bir anda gelir ve haz\u0131rl\u0131k pay\u0131n s\u0131f\u0131rd\u0131r. Bu ad\u0131mda i\u015f ba\u011flam\u0131nda haz\u0131rl\u0131ks\u0131z konu\u015fmay\u0131 \xe7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yorsun: s\xf6z alma, beklemedi\u011fin bir soruya cevap verme, itiraz\u0131 kar\u015f\u0131lama ve k\xf6t\xfc haberi ta\u015f\u0131ma. Zor olan kelime bilmemek de\u011fil karar h\u0131z\u0131d\u0131r \u2014 hangi c\xfcmleyi \xf6nce kuraca\u011f\u0131na saniyeler i\xe7inde karar vermen gerekir ve yanl\u0131\u015f s\u0131rayla ba\u015flayan c\xfcmle yar\u0131da \xe7\xf6ker. Kar\u015f\u0131ndaki seni bazen anlamaz; bu bir kay\u0131p de\u011fil al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rman\u0131n as\u0131l \xf6l\xe7\xfct\xfcd\xfcr, \xe7\xfcnk\xfc ger\xe7ek toplant\u0131da da olur ve orada da kendini onarman gerekir.",B.bgY,B.bhT,B.bcp,"Pratik > Do\u011fa\xe7lama'da listeden i\u015f sahnelerini se\xe7: 'Teslim tarihini ka\xe7\u0131rd\u0131n', 'K\u0131zg\u0131n m\xfc\u015fteri', 'B\xfct\xe7e donduruldu', 'Ekip arkada\u015f\u0131n\u0131 savun'. Brifi okuduktan sonra plan yapma, hemen konu\u015fmaya ba\u015fla; ilk c\xfcmlede duru\u015funu s\xf6yle, gerek\xe7eyi ikinci c\xfcmleye b\u0131rak. Bilmedi\u011fin bir say\u0131 sorulursa uydurma, s\u0131n\u0131rla ve takip s\xf6z\xfc ver. Partner seni anlamazsa c\xfcmleyi TEKRARLAMA \u2014 k\u0131salt, terimi de\u011fi\u015ftir ya da somut bir \xf6rnek ver. Hedef: 3 sahneyi en fazla 1 onar\u0131mla bitirmek.",B.bnt,null,null,null,null)
B.aXm=new A.r("Haz\u0131rl\u0131\u011f\u0131n yoksa: tepki ver, yank\u0131la, topu geri ver","Haz\u0131rl\u0131ks\u0131zken yeni konu aramak en yava\u015f hamledir; en h\u0131zl\u0131s\u0131 kar\u015f\u0131 taraf\u0131n son c\xfcmlesine tepki vermektir. Tepki haz\u0131r kal\u0131pt\u0131r ve d\xfc\u015f\xfcnme gerektirmez. Duyguya g\xf6re se\xe7ersin: Oh nice ve That sounds great iyi habere, Oh no ve That's rough k\xf6t\xfc habere, Really? ve No way \u015fa\u015f\u0131rt\u0131c\u0131 habere gider. Tepkiden sonra yank\u0131 sorusu gelir: kar\u015f\u0131 taraf\u0131n son kelimesini al\u0131r ve soruya \xe7evirirsin \u2014 You drove the whole way? What made you decide that? Bu yap\u0131 konu bulma y\xfck\xfcn\xfc s\u0131f\u0131ra indirir. Kendi pay\u0131n iki c\xfcmleyi ge\xe7mesin, sonra topu geri ver: What about you? Haz\u0131rl\u0131ks\u0131zken uzun anlatmak hem dil hatas\u0131 riskini hem monolog riskini b\xfcy\xfct\xfcr. Duraklama olursa doldurma sesi (\u0131\u0131\u0131\u0131) yerine zaman kazand\u0131ran bir kal\u0131p kullan: Let me think ya da That's a tough one. Bunlar hem do\u011fal duyulur hem sana saniye kazand\u0131r\u0131r.")
B.aYk=new A.r("Konuyu \xe7evirmek: k\xf6pr\xfc kur, kap\u0131y\u0131 \xe7arpma","Her konu bir yerde t\xfckenir; sorun t\xfckenmesi de\u011fil, t\xfckendi\u011finde sessizli\u011fe d\xfc\u015fmektir. K\xf6pr\xfc c\xfcmleleri konuyu kapatmadan yenisini a\xe7ar. \xdc\xe7 k\xf6pr\xfc yeter: Anyway, \u2026 konuyu yumu\u015fak\xe7a kapat\u0131r; By the way, \u2026 yan bir konuya ge\xe7er; That reminds me \u2014 \u2026 daha \xf6nce s\xf6ylenmi\u015f bir ayr\u0131nt\u0131ya d\xf6ner. En do\u011fal k\xf6pr\xfc, kar\u015f\u0131 taraf\u0131n daha \xf6nce s\xf6yledi\u011fi bir ayr\u0131nt\u0131ya d\xf6nmektir: That reminds me \u2014 you said you were learning to cook? Bu hem dinledi\u011fini g\xf6sterir hem yeni konu \xfcretir. Rahats\u0131z oldu\u011fun bir konu a\xe7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda da k\xf6pr\xfc kullan\u0131l\u0131r; reddetmeden y\xf6n de\u011fi\u015ftirmek en kibar \xe7\u0131k\u0131\u015ft\u0131r: I'm probably the wrong person to ask \u2014 by the way, did you see the garden? K\xf6pr\xfcs\xfcz ani ge\xe7i\u015f (So, what is your job?) sohbeti sorgu havas\u0131na sokar; tek bir ba\u011fla\xe7 c\xfcmlesi bunu tamamen \xf6nler.")
B.aZz=new A.r("Kibarca reddetmek: yumu\u015fat, sebep ver, alternatif b\u0131rak","\u0130ngilizce sosyal dilde \xe7\u0131plak bir hay\u0131r kap\u0131 kapat\u0131r. Reddetme \xfc\xe7 par\xe7al\u0131d\u0131r: istek belirt, k\u0131sa sebep ver, alternatif b\u0131rak. Kal\u0131p haz\u0131rd\u0131r: I'd love to, but I'm completely wiped out tonight \u2014 can I take a rain check? \xdc\xe7 par\xe7a da tek nefeste s\xf6ylenir ve kimse k\u0131r\u0131lmaz. Daha hafif bir red i\xe7in Thanks, but I'll pass yeterlidir; bu kal\u0131p sebep vermeden de kabul g\xf6ren nadir yap\u0131lardan biridir. Sebep uzun ve ayr\u0131nt\u0131l\u0131 olmamal\u0131: uzun a\xe7\u0131klama bahane gibi duyulur. Tek c\xfcmle her zaman daha inand\u0131r\u0131c\u0131d\u0131r. T\xfcrk\xe7edeki bakar\u0131z ya da art\u0131k bir ara gibi belirsiz kapatmalar T\xfcrk\xe7ede \xe7o\u011fu zaman kibar bir hay\u0131r olarak anla\u015f\u0131l\u0131r. \u0130ngilizcedeki birebir kar\u015f\u0131l\u0131klar\u0131 (we'll see, maybe some other time) da yumu\u015fak bir hay\u0131r olabilir ama ayn\u0131 g\xfcvenle \xf6yle duyulmaz: kar\u015f\u0131 taraf bunu ger\xe7ek bir belki san\u0131p davetini yineleyebilir. Hay\u0131r diyeceksen net ve kibar s\xf6yle; ertelemek istiyorsan rain check iste \u2014 rain check, tarih vermeden ama net bi\xe7imde ertelemektir.")
B.b2a=new A.r("Onar\u0131m: anlamad\u0131\u011f\u0131nda ve yanl\u0131\u015f anla\u015f\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda","Anlamad\u0131\u011f\u0131nda yaln\u0131zca Sorry? demek yerine NEY\u0130 anlamad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 s\xf6yle: Sorry, I didn't catch that last bit \u2014 the bus or the train? Bu, kar\u015f\u0131 tarafa t\xfcm c\xfcmleyi tekrarlatmaktan h\u0131zl\u0131d\u0131r ve daha nazik durur. \u0130sim unutmak sosyal do\u011fa\xe7laman\u0131n klasik an\u0131d\u0131r ve onar\u0131labilir: Sorry, I'm terrible with names \u2014 could you remind me? Kabahati kendine almak bilgiyi k\u0131rmadan geri getirir. Yanl\u0131\u015f anla\u015f\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda su\xe7u kar\u015f\u0131 tarafa atma; c\xfcmleyi sahiplen ve yeniden kur: That came out wrong \u2014 what I meant was your flat is bigger than mine. Anlamadan onaylamak (yes, yes, exactly) sohbette k\u0131sa vadede kurtar\u0131r ama bir sonraki c\xfcmlede yakalan\u0131rs\u0131n; anlamad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 s\xf6ylemek sosyal olarak tamamen normaldir. Onar\u0131m turu raporda g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcr ve seni cezaland\u0131rmaz; hangi c\xfcmlenin \xe7\xf6kt\xfc\u011f\xfcn\xfc g\xf6sterir. Hedefin onar\u0131m\u0131 s\u0131f\u0131rlamak de\u011fil, onar\u0131m\u0131 h\u0131zl\u0131 ve do\u011fal yapmakt\u0131r.")
