B.aKr=new A.O("Can you send me some informations about the tender?","Could you send me some information about the tender?","information say\u0131lamayan bir isimdir ve \xe7o\u011ful olmaz; ayr\u0131ca i\u015f yaz\u0131\u015fmas\u0131nda Can you yerine Could you daha nazik ve n\xf6tr durur.",null)
B.aJ8=new A.O("We made a big progress this week.","We made good progress this week.","progress de say\u0131lamaz: a ya da an almaz ve big yerine good ya da significant s\u0131fatlar\u0131yla gelir.",null)
B.aJi=new A.O("Our stuff is very motivated after the reorganization.","Our staff are very motivated after the reorganization.","stuff e\u015fya, staff \xe7al\u0131\u015fanlar demektir; ayr\u0131ca staff topluluk ismi oldu\u011fu i\xe7in Britanya kullan\u0131m\u0131nda \xe7o\u011ful fiil al\u0131r.",null)
