B.c5H=new A.bw("b-02-vocab-100","\u0130\u015f kelimelerini e\u015fdizimle \xf6\u011frenmek: meet a deadline, catch de\u011fil","Bu ad\u0131mda y\xfcz temel i\u015f kelimesini tek tek de\u011fil, birlikte kullan\u0131ld\u0131klar\u0131 fiillerle \xf6\u011freniyorsun. \u0130\u015f \u0130ngilizcesinde kelimeyi bilmek yetmez; deadline'\u0131n meet, target'\u0131n hit, budget'\u0131n approve fiiliyle geldi\u011fini bilmek gerekir, \xe7\xfcnk\xfc yanl\u0131\u015f fiil se\xe7imi kelimeyi hi\xe7 bilmemekten daha \xe7ok fark edilir. Ayr\u0131ca information, feedback ve progress gibi say\u0131lamayan isimler T\xfcrk profesyonellerin yaz\u0131\u015fmalar\u0131nda en s\u0131k hata kayna\u011f\u0131d\u0131r; bu ad\u0131mda o tuzaklar\u0131 kapatacaks\u0131n.",B.bcH,B.bkt,B.bku,"Kelime tekrar\u0131 b\xf6l\xfcm\xfcnde i\u015f paketini a\xe7 ve y\xfcz kart\u0131 bitir; her kart\u0131 \xfc\xe7 kolonlu doldur (kelime, e\u015fdizimi, kendi projenden bir c\xfcmle) ve kartlar\u0131 alfabetik de\u011fil senaryoya g\xf6re grupla: toplant\u0131, b\xfct\xe7e, m\xfc\u015fteri, teslim. Sonra say\u0131lamayan isimleri ayr\u0131 bir listeye \xe7\u0131kar (information, feedback, advice, progress, research, staff) ve her biri i\xe7in some ya da a piece of ile bir c\xfcmle yaz\u0131p sesli s\xf6yle.",B.bue,null,null,null,null)
B.b2m=new A.r("Konu sat\u0131r\u0131 ve ilk c\xfcmle karar\u0131 belirler","\u0130yi bir konu sat\u0131r\u0131 eylem, konu ve gerekiyorsa tarih i\xe7erir ve alt\u0131 sekiz kelimeyi ge\xe7mez: Approval needed \u2014 Q3 marketing budget (by Fri). Hello, Question, Urgent gibi tek kelimelik konular hem gecikmeye hem de aramada kaybolmaya yol a\xe7ar; al\u0131c\u0131 gelen kutusunda ne yapmas\u0131 gerekti\u011fini konu sat\u0131r\u0131ndan anlamal\u0131. \u0130lk c\xfcmle amac\u0131 s\xf6yler: I'm writing to ask whether\u2026 ya da I'm following up on\u2026 Yaz\u0131n\u0131n ortas\u0131nda ortaya \xe7\u0131kan bir rica \xe7o\u011fu zaman okunmaz. I hope this email finds you well kal\u0131b\u0131 art\u0131k \xe7ok a\u015f\u0131nm\u0131\u015f bir a\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015ft\u0131r; tan\u0131d\u0131\u011f\u0131n biriyle yaz\u0131\u015f\u0131yorsan Thanks for your quick reply ya da Hope your week is off to a good start daha canl\u0131 durur. Paragraflar\u0131 iki \xfc\xe7 c\xfcmlede tut ve birden fazla ricay\u0131 madde madde yaz; duvar gibi metin, cevab\u0131n yar\u0131m kalmas\u0131n\u0131n en s\u0131k sebebidir.")
B.aXt=new A.r("Rica, ret ve k\xf6t\xfc haber: yumu\u015fatma ara\xe7lar\u0131","Rica merdiveni nezaket s\u0131ras\u0131na g\xf6re \u015f\xf6yledir: Please send\u2026 (en sert), Could you send\u2026, Would you be able to send\u2026, I'd appreciate it if you could send\u2026 (en yumu\u015fak). T\xfcrk\xe7ede emir kipi rica tonuyla yumu\u015fat\u0131labildi\u011fi i\xe7in Please send me the report c\xfcmlesi bize kibar gelir; \u0130ngilizce okuyan bir m\xfc\u015fteriye ise talimat gibi ula\u015f\u0131r. K\xf6t\xfc haberi \xfc\xe7 ara\xe7la yumu\u015fat: I'm afraid ile ba\u015fla, \xf6l\xe7\xfcy\xfc k\xfc\xe7\xfclt (a slight delay, a small gap), ve hemen ard\u0131ndan yeni tarihi ver. Su\xe7u ki\u015fiye de\u011fil s\xfcrece ba\u011fla. Belirsizlik varsa temkinli dil kullan: It looks like, there seems to be, from what I can see. Kesin konu\u015fup sonra geri ad\u0131m atmak g\xfcveni as\u0131l zedeleyen \u015feydir. Takip e-postas\u0131 su\xe7lama i\xe7ermez: Just following up on my email from Tuesday, any update on the invoice? Bu c\xfcmle hat\u0131rlat\u0131r ama kimseyi k\xf6\u015feye s\u0131k\u0131\u015ft\u0131rmaz.")
B.aRB=new A.r("A\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015f-kapan\u0131\u015f \xe7iftleri ve bi\xe7im kurallar\u0131","Hitap ve imza birbirine ba\u011fl\u0131d\u0131r: Dear Ms. Demir ile Kind regards, Hi Elif ile Best ya da Thanks e\u015fle\u015fir; resm\xee hitab\u0131n alt\u0131na Cheers yazmak tonu bozar. Ad\u0131n\u0131 bilmedi\u011fin bir ki\u015fiye Dear Sir or Madam art\u0131k eskidir; Dear Hiring Team ya da Dear Finance Team gibi rol tabanl\u0131 hitaplar ya da yal\u0131n bir Hello tercih edilir. Dear Ms. Elif gibi ad + unvan birle\u015fimi ise yanl\u0131\u015ft\u0131r. Ek g\xf6nderirken I've attached the revised proposal modern ve do\u011fal, Please find attached daha resm\xeedir; ikisi de do\u011frudur ama ekin ne oldu\u011funu s\xf6ylemek zorunludur. Kapan\u0131\u015f c\xfcmlesi sonraki ad\u0131m\u0131, sahibini ve tarihi i\xe7erir: I'll send the final numbers by Wednesday noon. Te\u015fekk\xfcr c\xfcmlesi bunun yerine ge\xe7mez. CC'ye birini eklerken sebebini bir c\xfcmleyle yaz (I'm copying Murat, who owns the contract); habersiz eklenen y\xf6netici, yaz\u0131\u015fmay\u0131 bask\u0131 arac\u0131na \xe7evirir.")
