B.c6g=new A.bw("b-03-email-templates","E-posta: konu sat\u0131r\u0131ndan kapan\u0131\u015fa kadar","Bu ad\u0131mda i\u015f e-postas\u0131n\u0131n sabit iskeletini \xf6\u011freniyorsun: cevap alan bir konu sat\u0131r\u0131, amac\u0131 s\xf6yleyen ilk c\xfcmle, yumu\u015fat\u0131lm\u0131\u015f bir rica ve somut bir kapan\u0131\u015f. E-posta \xe7o\u011fu profesyonel i\xe7in \u0130ngilizcesinin en \xe7ok g\xf6r\xfcld\xfc\u011f\xfc yerdir; tek bir sert emir c\xfcmlesi ya da yanl\u0131\u015f hitap, saatlerce haz\u0131rlad\u0131\u011f\u0131n i\u015fin izlenimini bozar. Bu ad\u0131m\u0131n sonunda rica, gecikme bildirimi ve takip e-postas\u0131n\u0131 d\xfc\u015f\xfcnmeden kurabilecek, k\xf6t\xfc haberi kaba olmadan s\xf6yleyebileceksin.",B.bcu,B.bzW,B.bt3,"Essay b\xf6l\xfcm\xfcnde orta seviyede \xfc\xe7 e-posta yaz: biri bir m\xfc\u015fteriden belge isteyen rica, biri gecikme bildiren k\xf6t\xfc haber, biri cevaps\u0131z kalan bir konunun takibi. Her e-postada eylem ve tarih i\xe7eren bir konu sat\u0131r\u0131, amac\u0131 s\xf6yleyen tek c\xfcmlelik bir a\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015f, Could you ya da Would you be able to ile kurulmu\u015f bir rica, sonraki ad\u0131m\u0131 tarihle veren bir kapan\u0131\u015f ve hitapla uyumlu bir imza bulunsun; hi\xe7birinde tek ba\u015f\u0131na emir kipi kullanma.",B.bqY,null,null,null,null)
B.b0k=new A.r("D\xf6rt evre, d\xf6rt kelime grubu","A\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015f: Shall we get started, let's run through the agenda, the first item is, is there any AOB (any other business). Zaman ve kapsam\u0131 ba\u015ftan s\xf6ylemek toplant\u0131n\u0131n tonunu belirler. Y\xf6netim: let's move on to, let's come back to that, can we park that for now, we're running short on time, let's take this offline. Katk\u0131: can I jump in, sorry to interrupt, just to build on that, to add to what Elif said, can I push back on that slightly. Kapan\u0131\u015f: so the action item is, who's the owner, by when, let me recap, I'll circle back on Thursday, I'll share the minutes. Kelimeleri bu d\xf6rt kutuya yerle\u015ftirerek \xf6\u011frenirsen toplant\u0131 s\u0131ras\u0131nda kelime aramazs\u0131n; hangi evrede oldu\u011funu bilir ve o kutudan haz\u0131r bir c\xfcmle \xe7ekersin.")
B.aXu=new A.r("S\xf6z alma, s\xf6z verme ve \xe7evrimi\xe7i toplant\u0131 mekani\u011fi","S\xf6z alman\u0131n nazik bi\xe7imi araya girmeyi \xf6nce kabul etmektir: Sorry to interrupt, can I jump in on that point? Araya hi\xe7 girmemek \u0130ngilizce toplant\u0131da al\xe7akg\xf6n\xfcll\xfcl\xfck de\u011fil, katk\u0131s\u0131zl\u0131k say\u0131l\u0131r. S\xf6z\xfc devretmek de bir beceridir: Elif, do you want to take this one? Ya da ayn\u0131 anda konu\u015ftu\u011funuzda Go ahead, you first diyerek \xe7at\u0131\u015fmay\u0131 bir saniyede \xe7\xf6zersin. \xc7evrimi\xe7i toplant\u0131n\u0131n kendi s\xf6zleri vard\u0131r: you're on mute, you cut out for a second, can everyone see my screen, I'll drop the link in the chat, let's go round the room. Anlamad\u0131\u011f\u0131nda repeat please demek yerine Sorry, could you say that again? ya da ba\u011flant\u0131 sorunuysa Sorry, you cut out for a second demek do\u011fal olan\u0131d\u0131r. Konu da\u011f\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda toplant\u0131y\u0131 kurtaran c\xfcmle haz\u0131r durmal\u0131: Let's take that offline and keep this call to the rollout.")
B.b_S=new A.r("Deyimleri ve \xf6bek fiilleri nas\u0131l \xf6\u011frenmeli","Toplant\u0131 deyimleri ezber listesi olarak de\u011fil, tek bir kal\u0131p c\xfcmlesiyle \xf6\u011frenilir: Let me run this by legal, I'll loop you in, let's flesh that out next week, can you give me a ballpark? Anlam kaymas\u0131 riski y\xfcksek olanlara dikkat: table an item Britanya kullan\u0131m\u0131nda g\xfcndeme almak, Amerika kullan\u0131m\u0131nda ertelemek demektir; kar\u0131\u015f\u0131k ekipte park it ya da defer it kullanmak g\xfcvenlidir. circle back ve touch base takip anlam\u0131ndad\u0131r ama tarih vermeden kullan\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda i\u015fi savma izlenimi b\u0131rak\u0131r; her deyimin yan\u0131na somut bir bilgi koy. Deyim dozunu d\xfc\u015f\xfck tut: bir toplant\u0131da iki \xfc\xe7 deyim do\u011fald\u0131r, her c\xfcmlede deyim kullanmak yeni \xf6\u011frenildi\u011fini g\xf6sterir ve netli\u011fi d\xfc\u015f\xfcr\xfcr. Kart \xe7al\u0131\u015f\u0131rken deyimin yan\u0131na hangi evrede kullan\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 yaz (park it: y\xf6netim, action item: kapan\u0131\u015f); bu etiket, deyimi do\u011fru anda hat\u0131rlaman\u0131 sa\u011flar.")
