B.c6u=new A.bw("b-04-meeting-vocab","Toplant\u0131 dili: s\xf6z almak, s\xf6z\xfc vermek, karar\u0131 kaydetmek","Bu ad\u0131mda toplant\u0131n\u0131n d\xf6rt evresini ayr\u0131 ayr\u0131 kelime setleriyle \xf6\u011freniyorsun: a\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015f, y\xf6netim, katk\u0131 ve kapan\u0131\u015f. \u0130ngilizce toplant\u0131da en \xe7ok kaybedilen yer s\xf6z alma an\u0131d\u0131r; do\u011fru \xfc\xe7 kelimeyi bilmeyen ki\u015fi fikri oldu\u011fu halde susar ya da s\xf6z\xfc keserek rahats\u0131zl\u0131k yarat\u0131r. Ayr\u0131ca circle back, park it, loop in gibi \xf6bek fiiller ve deyimler bu ortamda \xe7ok yo\u011fun ge\xe7er; bunlar\u0131 tan\u0131mdan de\u011fil, hangi evrede hangi yuvaya girdi\u011finden \xf6\u011freneceksin.",B.baC,B.bbe,B.bm0,"Kelime tekrar\u0131 b\xf6l\xfcm\xfcnde toplant\u0131 kartlar\u0131n\u0131 \xe7al\u0131\u015f ve her kart\u0131n arkas\u0131na hangi evrede kullan\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 etiketle (a\xe7, y\xf6net, kat\u0131l, kapat); park it, circle back, loop in, run by, take it offline i\xe7in kendi ekibinden birer ger\xe7ek c\xfcmle yaz. Sonra son kat\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131n toplant\u0131y\u0131 hat\u0131rlay\u0131p d\xf6rt evrenin her biri i\xe7in bir c\xfcmleyi sesli s\xf6yle: g\xfcndemi a\xe7, bir maddeyi ertele, araya gir, bir aksiyon maddesini sahip ve tarihle kapat.",B.bm3,null,null,null,null)
B.b1x=new A.r("Fikri sunman\u0131n \xfc\xe7 katman\u0131: iddia, kan\u0131t, istek","G\xfc\xe7l\xfc bir katk\u0131 \xfc\xe7 par\xe7adan olu\u015fur: ne \xf6neriyorsun, hangi veriye dayan\u0131yor, toplant\u0131dan ne istiyorsun. I'd suggest we delay the launch by a week, because the payment flow still fails on three percent of orders, so I'd like approval for a short fix window. Zay\u0131f katk\u0131 ise belirsiz kal\u0131r: I think maybe we can do something about this. Bu c\xfcmle bilgi ta\u015f\u0131mad\u0131\u011f\u0131 i\xe7in toplant\u0131da kar\u015f\u0131l\u0131k bulmaz. Uzunlu\u011fu ba\u015ftan i\u015faretlemek dinlenme \u015fans\u0131n\u0131 art\u0131r\u0131r: Two quick points, or Just one thing on the timeline. Kar\u015f\u0131 taraf ne kadar s\xfcrede s\xf6z\xfc geri alaca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 bilir. Say\u0131y\u0131 ilk c\xfcmleye koy; \u0130ngilizce i\u015f k\xfclt\xfcr\xfcnde \xf6nce sonu\xe7, sonra gerek\xe7e beklenir, T\xfcrk\xe7edeki uzun haz\u0131rl\u0131k giri\u015fleri sab\u0131rs\u0131zl\u0131k yarat\u0131r. Kendi fikrine g\xfcvenmedi\u011fin durumda bile \xf6z\xfcr dilemeden s\xf6yle: This might be worth checking yap\u0131s\u0131, I'm sorry, maybe my idea is stupid gibi c\xfcmlelerden kat kat etkilidir.")
B.b1c=new A.r("Nazik anla\u015fmazl\u0131k: \xf6nce kabul et, sonra s\u0131n\u0131rla","\u0130ngilizce itiraz neredeyse her zaman iki ad\u0131md\u0131r: kar\u015f\u0131 taraf\u0131n bir par\xe7as\u0131n\u0131 kabul et, sonra s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131n\u0131 koy. That's a fair point, but my concern is the support load in December. Kullan\u0131\u015fl\u0131 yap\u0131lar: I see where you're coming from, I'd push back on the timeline though, I'm not sure that would work for the enterprise accounts, I'd be careful about promising that. \xc7\u0131plak I disagree ya da You are wrong c\xfcmleleri teknik olarak do\u011fru ama toplant\u0131da ili\u015fkiyi bozar; \u0130ngilizcede itiraz ki\u015fiye de\u011fil fikre, \xe7o\u011fu zaman veriye y\xf6neltilir. Soru bi\xe7imindeki itiraz en g\xfc\xe7l\xfcs\xfcd\xfcr \xe7\xfcnk\xfc kar\u015f\u0131 taraf\u0131 d\xfc\u015f\xfcnmeye \xe7a\u011f\u0131r\u0131r: Have we considered what happens if the vendor misses the date? Yumu\u015fatma s\xf6zc\xfckleri itiraz\u0131 zay\u0131flatmaz, kabul edilebilir yapar: slightly, a bit, might, tend to, I'd say. Bunlar\u0131 kullanmak \xe7ekingenlik de\u011fil profesyonellik i\u015faretidir.")
B.aSp=new A.r("Karar\u0131 ve aksiyon maddelerini kapatmak","Toplant\u0131y\u0131 kapatan ki\u015fi karar\u0131n ne oldu\u011funu tek c\xfcmlede s\xf6yler: Let me recap, we're going with option B, and Murat owns the migration plan. Her aksiyon maddesinde \xfc\xe7 par\xe7a bulunur: sahip, eylem, tarih. Sahip belirtilmeden verilen g\xf6rev hi\xe7 verilmemi\u015f say\u0131l\u0131r. Sessizlik onay de\u011fildir; karar\u0131 kapatmadan \xf6nce ad\u0131yla teyit al: Elif, does that work for you? Bu soru sonradan \xe7\u0131kan itirazlar\u0131n \xe7o\u011funu engeller. Konu da\u011f\u0131l\u0131rsa toplant\u0131y\u0131 kurtaracak c\xfcmle haz\u0131r olmal\u0131: Let's take that offline. S\xfcre daral\u0131yorsa a\xe7\u0131k\xe7a s\xf6yle: We've got five minutes left, so let's decide the date and park the rest. Kapan\u0131\u015ftan sonra karar\u0131 yaz\u0131ya ge\xe7irmek toplant\u0131n\u0131n bir par\xe7as\u0131d\u0131r: I'll follow up in writing by end of day. Yaz\u0131lmayan karar bir hafta i\xe7inde tart\u0131\u015fmaya geri d\xf6ner.")
B.bb8=s([B.b1x,B.b1c,B.aSp],t.q)
