B.c6B=new A.bw("b-05-meeting-roleplay","Toplant\u0131 sim\xfclasyonu: fikir sunmak, nazik\xe7e itiraz etmek, kapatmak","Bu ad\u0131mda toplant\u0131 kelimelerini ger\xe7ek bir ak\u0131\u015fta kullan\u0131yorsun: g\xfcndemi a\xe7mak, fikri gerek\xe7esiyle sunmak, anla\u015fmazl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ki\u015fiselle\u015ftirmeden y\xf6netmek ve karar\u0131 sahibiyle kapatmak. \u0130ngilizce toplant\u0131da en s\u0131k kaybedilen \u015fey hakl\u0131l\u0131k de\u011fil, itiraz\u0131n tonudur: do\u011fru fikri yanl\u0131\u015f tonla s\xf6ylemek fikri g\xf6mer. Bu ad\u0131m\u0131n sonunda hem itiraz edebilecek hem de toplant\u0131y\u0131 belirsiz b\u0131rakmadan bitirebileceksin.",B.bb8,B.bxP,B.b6r,"Roleplay senaryosunda Toplant\u0131 sahnesini be\u015f kez tamamla: bir turda g\xfcndemi sen a\xe7, bir turda say\u0131sal gerek\xe7eli bir \xf6neri sun, bir turda k\u0131demli birinin fikrine nazik\xe7e itiraz et, bir turda anla\u015fmazl\u0131\u011f\u0131 se\xe7enek sunarak \xe7\xf6z, son turda toplant\u0131y\u0131 kapat. Her turda \xf6nce kabul sonra s\u0131n\u0131r yap\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 bir kez kullan, hi\xe7bir c\xfcmlede you ile ba\u015flayarak ele\u015ftiri yapma ve her turu sahip, eylem ve tarih i\xe7eren bir aksiyon maddesiyle bitir.",B.bxY,null,null,null,null)
B.b1N=new A.r("Signposting: her yuvaya iki kal\u0131p yeter","Sunum dili alt\u0131 yuvadan olu\u015fur ve her yuva i\xe7in iki haz\u0131r kal\u0131p bilmek y\xfcz kal\u0131b\u0131 tan\u0131maktan iyidir, \xe7\xfcnk\xfc se\xe7enek azl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ak\u0131c\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131 art\u0131r\u0131r. A\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015f: Today I'll cover three things, I've split this into three parts, I'll take questions at the end. Dinleyici s\xfcreyi ve yap\u0131y\u0131 ba\u015ftan bilmeli. Ge\xe7i\u015f: That brings me to, Let me move on to, Before I do that, let me quickly. Vurgu: The key point here is, What's important is, If you remember one thing from this slide. Kapan\u0131\u015f: To sum up, So where does that leave us, That's all from me \u2014 happy to take questions. Kapan\u0131\u015f\u0131 Thank you for your attention ile bitirmek yerine \xf6zet ve istekle bitirmek etkiyi ikiye katlar. Kartlar\u0131n\u0131 bu yuvalara g\xf6re grupla ve her yuvadan kendi sunumun i\xe7in bir c\xfcmle yaz; kelime listesi olarak \xe7al\u0131\u015f\u0131lan kal\u0131plar sahnede geri gelmez.")
B.aSo=new A.r("Veriyi anlatmak: fiil, y\xf6n ve \xf6l\xe7ek","Y\xf6n fiilleri sabittir: rise, increase, climb, grow; fall, drop, decline, dip; level off, peak at, bottom out. Bunlara \xf6l\xe7\xfc eklenir: up twelve percent, down by two points, flat quarter on quarter. En kritik ayr\u0131m y\xfczde ile y\xfczde puan\u0131d\u0131r: churn fell by two percentage points, from nine to seven c\xfcmlesi do\u011frudur; two percent demek tamamen farkl\u0131 bir b\xfcy\xfckl\xfckt\xfcr. by ve to edatlar\u0131 kar\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131lmaz: increased by 12 percent art\u0131\u015f miktar\u0131n\u0131, increased to 12 percent ula\u015f\u0131lan seviyeyi anlat\u0131r. Yakla\u015f\u0131kl\u0131k i\u015faretleri profesyonellik g\xf6stergesidir: roughly, just over, just under, in the region of, broadly in line with last year. Kesin olmayan say\u0131y\u0131 kesin s\xf6ylemek en s\u0131k soru-cevap kazas\u0131d\u0131r. Say\u0131 okumada T\xfcrk\xe7e al\u0131\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131 tuzakt\u0131r: 1,5 milyon \u0130ngilizcede one point five million, 2026 y\u0131l\u0131 twenty twenty-six, y\xfczde 0,5 ise zero point five percent diye okunur.")
B.aUS=new A.r("Grafik anlat\u0131m\u0131, soru-cevap ve zaman y\xf6netimi","Grafi\u011fi anlatmadan \xf6nce y\xf6nlendir, sonra oku: As you can see on this slide, the dotted line is our forecast, not actuals. Dinleyici neye bakaca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 bilmeden say\u0131 duymaya ba\u015flarsa kaybolur. Eksen ve birimi bir kez s\xf6ylemek zorunludur: the vertical axis is monthly active users, in thousands. Bu c\xfcmle atlan\u0131nca b\xfct\xfcn grafik tart\u0131\u015fmaya a\xe7\u0131k hale gelir. Soruya cevap verirken \xf6nce soruyu teyit et: Just to make sure I understood, you're asking whether the pilot covers both markets? Bu bir saniyelik hamle yanl\u0131\u015f cevab\u0131 \xf6nler. Bilmedi\u011fin say\u0131y\u0131 uydurmak yerine s\xf6z ver: I don't have that figure to hand \u2014 I'll send it right after the session. Bu c\xfcmle profesyonelli\u011fi d\xfc\u015f\xfcrmez, y\xfckseltir. S\xfcre daral\u0131rsa sessizce h\u0131zlanmak yerine i\u015faretle: I'm conscious of time, so I'll keep the last part short. Dinleyici plan\u0131n de\u011fi\u015fti\u011fini bilirse takip etmeye devam eder.")
B.b7r=s([B.b1N,B.aSo,B.aUS],t.q)
B.awD=new A.p("Today I'll cover three things: where we are, what's blocking us, and what I need from you.","Bug\xfcn \xfc\xe7 \u015feyi ele alaca\u011f\u0131m: nerede oldu\u011fumuzu, neyin bizi engelledi\u011fini ve sizden ne istedi\u011fimi.","A\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015fta \xfc\xe7 maddelik harita",null)
B.ayI=new A.p("That brings me to the second part \u2014 pricing.","Bu da beni ikinci b\xf6l\xfcme getiriyor: fiyatland\u0131rma.","Ge\xe7i\u015f i\u015fareti; slayt de\u011fi\u015fimini s\xf6zle de haber ver",null)
B.aI_=new A.p("Revenue was up twelve percent quarter on quarter, driven mainly by renewals.","Gelir \xe7eyrek baz\u0131nda y\xfczde on iki artt\u0131; ba\u015fl\u0131ca etken yenilemeler.","Art\u0131\u015f + sebep ayn\u0131 c\xfcmlede",null)
B.aEN=new A.p("Churn fell by two percentage points, from nine to seven.","M\xfc\u015fteri kayb\u0131 iki y\xfczde puan d\xfc\u015ft\xfc: dokuzdan yediye.","percentage point ile percent fark\u0131",null)
B.aHW=new A.p("As you can see, the dotted line is our forecast, not actuals \u2014 the axis is in thousands.","G\xf6rd\xfc\u011f\xfcn\xfcz gibi kesikli \xe7izgi ger\xe7ekle\u015fen de\u011fil tahminimiz; eksen bin birimiyle.","Grafikte \xf6nce y\xf6nlendir, sonra oku",null)
B.aH2=new A.p("The key point here is that we don't need more traffic; we need better onboarding.","Buradaki kritik nokta \u015fu: daha fazla trafi\u011fe de\u011fil, daha iyi bir ba\u015flang\u0131\xe7 ak\u0131\u015f\u0131na ihtiyac\u0131m\u0131z var.","Vurgu i\u015fareti, slayt\u0131n tek c\xfcmlelik \xf6zeti",null)
B.avm=new A.p("To sum up: the pilot works, and we'd like to scale it to two more markets.","\xd6zetle: pilot \xe7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yor ve bunu iki pazara daha yaymak istiyoruz.","Kapan\u0131\u015f: \xf6zet + istek, te\u015fekk\xfcr c\xfcmlesi de\u011fil",null)
B.awA=new A.p("I don't have that figure to hand \u2014 I'll send it right after the session.","O say\u0131 \u015fu an elimde de\u011fil; oturumdan hemen sonra g\xf6nderece\u011fim.","Bilmedi\u011fini s\xf6ylemenin profesyonel bi\xe7imi",null)
