B.c72=new A.bw("b-10-exec-vocab","Executive kelimeler: jargonu anlaml\u0131 c\xfcmlede kullanmak","Bu ad\u0131mda \xfcst y\xf6netim toplant\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131n kelime da\u011farc\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 \xf6\u011freniyorsun: stakeholder, leverage, ROI, KPI, runway, headcount, scope creep, alignment, escalate ve arkada\u015flar\u0131. Ama\xe7 bu kelimeleri tan\u0131mak de\u011fil, her birini bir say\u0131 ya da somut bir eyleme ba\u011fl\u0131 c\xfcmlede kullanabilmek; \xe7\xfcnk\xfc bu seviyede bo\u015f jargon en h\u0131zl\u0131 g\xfcven kaybettiren \u015feydir. Ayr\u0131ca eventually, actual ve sympathetic gibi yalanc\u0131 e\u015f dostlar tam bu ortamda kaza yapar: kelimeyi T\xfcrk\xe7edeki benzerine g\xf6re kullanmak c\xfcmlenin anlam\u0131n\u0131 tersine \xe7evirir.",B.bxO,B.b77,B.b7B,"Kelime tekrar\u0131 b\xf6l\xfcm\xfcnde executive kelime kartlar\u0131n\u0131 \xe7al\u0131\u015f ve her karta bir fiil e\u015fi art\u0131 kendi \u015firketinden bir say\u0131 ekle (14 months of runway, freeze headcount this quarter, ROI in four months). Sonra yalanc\u0131 e\u015f dostlar i\xe7in ayr\u0131 bir liste yap (eventually, actual, sympathetic, control, sensible, economical, attend) ve her biri i\xe7in do\u011fru ve yanl\u0131\u015f kullan\u0131m\u0131 yan yana yaz; son olarak jargon testini uygula: yazd\u0131\u011f\u0131n be\u015f c\xfcmleden jargonu \xe7\u0131kar ve bilgi kalmayan c\xfcmleleri d\xfcz \u0130ngilizceyle yeniden yaz.",B.bf8,null,null,null,null)
