B.aR5=new A.O("I sent a pull request to you.","I opened a pull request and added you as a reviewer.","PR bir ki\u015fiye g\xf6nderilmez: a\xe7\u0131l\u0131r ve inceleyici ayr\u0131 bir eylemle eklenir, bu y\xfczden iki bilgi ayr\u0131 s\xf6ylenir. Tek ba\u015f\u0131na send a PR a\xe7\u0131k kaynakta yayg\u0131nd\u0131r; tuhaf olan PR'\u0131 bir ki\u015fiye g\xf6ndermektir.",null)
