B.c6E=new A.bw("t-08-git-workflow","Git ve i\u015f ak\u0131\u015f\u0131: pull request etraf\u0131ndaki dil","Bu ad\u0131mda g\xfcnl\xfck git i\u015flerini ve pull request etraf\u0131ndaki konu\u015fmalar\u0131 \u0130ngilizce y\xfcr\xfctmeyi \xf6\u011freniyorsun. Bir PR a\xe7may\u0131, inceleme istemeyi, \xe7ak\u0131\u015fma \xe7\xf6zmeyi ve bir de\u011fi\u015fikli\u011fi geri almay\u0131 do\u011fru fiillerle anlatabileceksin. Ayr\u0131ca LGTM ve nit gibi ekip i\xe7i k\u0131saltmalar\u0131n ne anlama geldi\u011fini ve hangi tonu ta\u015f\u0131d\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 \xf6\u011freneceksin.",B.biq,B.b71,B.bxv,"Kelime tekrar\u0131 b\xf6l\xfcm\xfcnde git ve i\u015f ak\u0131\u015f\u0131 kartlar\u0131n\u0131 \xe7al\u0131\u015f; sonra a\xe7\u0131k bir PR'\u0131n\u0131 d\xfc\u015f\xfcnerek \xfc\xe7 c\xfcmle yaz ve sesli s\xf6yle: PR'\u0131 tan\u0131tan bir c\xfcmle, bir inceleyiciden nazik\xe7e bakmas\u0131n\u0131 isteyen bir c\xfcmle ve bir nit yorumu; her c\xfcmlede do\u011fru git fiilini kullan.",B.b6M,null,null,null,null)
B.aSr=new A.r("Ad\u0131mlar emir kipiyle ve numaral\u0131 yaz\u0131l\u0131r","Steps to reproduce b\xf6l\xfcm\xfc anlat\u0131 de\u011fil talimatt\u0131r: open the app, log in as a free user, upload a file over five megabytes. \xd6zne kullan\u0131lmaz, \xe7\xfcnk\xfc okuyan ki\u015fi ad\u0131mlar\u0131 kendisi uygulayacakt\u0131r; I opened the app yerine open the app yaz\u0131l\u0131r. Her ad\u0131m tek bir eylem i\xe7ermelidir; iki eylemi tek sat\u0131ra s\u0131k\u0131\u015ft\u0131rmak yeniden \xfcretmeyi zorla\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r. Ortam bilgisi ayr\u0131 bir sat\u0131ra yaz\u0131l\u0131r: version, platform, environment, account type. Ne kadar s\u0131k oldu\u011funu da eklemek gerekir: it happens every time ya da it is intermittent, roughly one in five attempts.")
B.aXa=new A.r("Beklenen ve ger\xe7ekle\u015fen davran\u0131\u015f\u0131 ay\u0131rmak","Expected ve actual iki ayr\u0131 c\xfcmledir ve ikisi de g\xf6zlem dilindedir: expected, the file uploads and appears in the list; actual, the request returns a five hundred. Yorum ve tahmin bu b\xf6l\xfcme kar\u0131\u015fmamal\u0131d\u0131r; onlar i\xe7in ayr\u0131 bir k\xf6k neden b\xf6l\xfcm\xfc vard\u0131r. T\xfcrk m\xfchendislerin en s\u0131k yapt\u0131\u011f\u0131 \u015fey bu ikisini tek c\xfcmlede birle\u015ftirip belirsiz bir \u015fik\xe2yete d\xf6n\xfc\u015ft\xfcrmektir. Hata mesaj\u0131n\u0131 oldu\u011fu gibi yap\u0131\u015ft\u0131rmak, onu kendi c\xfcmlenle anlatmaktan her zaman daha de\u011ferlidir. Ekran g\xf6r\xfcnt\xfcs\xfc ya da kay\u0131t varsa bunu belirtmek okuyan\u0131n i\u015fini ciddi bi\xe7imde kolayla\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r.")
B.aY_=new A.r("Etki, \xf6ncelik ve temkinli k\xf6k neden","Etki kullan\u0131c\u0131 say\u0131s\u0131 ya da oranla verilir: this affects all paying customers on mobile, roughly twelve percent of sessions. Aciliyet talep edilirken gerek\xe7e verilir; please fix urgent yerine this is blocking all paid users, could we prioritise it denir. K\xf6k neden tahmini kesinlik iddias\u0131 ta\u015f\u0131mamal\u0131d\u0131r: it looks like a stale cache entry, my current theory is that the token expires early. Bu temkinli dil zay\u0131fl\u0131k de\u011fil, C1 g\xf6stergesidir; kan\u0131t\u0131n ne kadar\u0131n\u0131 g\xf6rd\xfc\u011f\xfcn\xfc d\xfcr\xfcst\xe7e i\u015faretler. Tahminin yanl\u0131\u015f \xe7\u0131kt\u0131\u011f\u0131nda bu dil sayesinde itibar kaybetmezsin ve tart\u0131\u015fma a\xe7\u0131k kal\u0131r.")
