B.c7e=new A.bw("t-09-bug-report","Bug raporu: belirsiz \u015fik\xe2yeti yeniden \xfcretilebilir kan\u0131ta \xe7evirmek","Bu ad\u0131mda bir hatay\u0131 okuyan\u0131n ayn\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 tekrar \xfcretebilece\u011fi netlikte yazmay\u0131 \xf6\u011freniyorsun. Ad\u0131mlar\u0131 emir kipiyle s\u0131ralamay\u0131, beklenen ve ger\xe7ekle\u015fen davran\u0131\u015f\u0131 yan yana koymay\u0131, etkiyi \xf6l\xe7\xfcyle bildirmeyi ve k\xf6k neden tahminini temkinli bir dille sunmay\u0131 \xe7al\u0131\u015facaks\u0131n. \u0130yi yaz\u0131lm\u0131\u015f bir bug raporu, \u0130ngilizcen m\xfckemmel olmasa bile seni ciddiye al\u0131nan bir m\xfchendis yapar.",B.bwP,B.bgi,B.bin,"Essay b\xf6l\xfcm\xfcnde orta seviyede iki bug raporu yaz: birinde her seferinde tekrarlanan, di\u011ferinde aral\u0131kl\u0131 bir hata anlat; her raporda numaral\u0131 ve emir kipinde ad\u0131mlar, ayr\u0131 expected ve actual c\xfcmleleri, \xf6l\xe7\xfcl\xfc bir etki ifadesi ve it looks like ile ba\u015flayan tek bir k\xf6k neden tahmini bulunsun.",B.b4W,null,null,null,null)
B.aZY=new A.r("\xdc\xe7 b\xf6l\xfcm, \xfc\xe7 farkl\u0131 zaman","D\xfcn i\xe7in past simple kullan\u0131l\u0131r: yesterday I finished the migration script. Bug\xfcn i\xe7in going to ya da present continuous kullan\u0131l\u0131r: today I'm going to start the API integration. Engel i\xe7in present continuous ya da basit present kullan\u0131l\u0131r: I'm blocked by the missing credentials, I'm waiting on the design review. D\xfcn bitmi\u015f bir zaman dilimi oldu\u011fu i\xe7in present perfect kullan\u0131lamaz; yesterday I have finished yap\u0131s\u0131 yanl\u0131\u015ft\u0131r. Bu \xfc\xe7 kal\u0131b\u0131 ezberden \xe7\u0131karabilmek toplant\u0131da c\xfcmle kurma y\xfck\xfcn\xfc tamamen ortadan kald\u0131r\u0131r.")
B.aXC=new A.r("Engeli su\xe7lamadan adland\u0131rmak","Engel i\xe7in blocked by ve waiting on kullan\u0131l\u0131r; from ki\u015fiden \xf6nce gelmez (blocked from Ahmet yanl\u0131\u015ft\u0131r), yaln\u0131zca bir eylemden \xf6nce gelir: I'm blocked from deploying. blocked because of someone ise ki\u015fiyi su\xe7lar gibi duyulur. Ki\u015fiyi engel olarak g\xf6stermek yerine beklenen \u015feyi g\xf6stermek normdur: I'm waiting on the staging credentials, not I'm blocked by Ahmet. Yard\u0131m isterken net ol: I need someone with database access for about twenty minutes. Bir i\u015fin gecikti\u011fini s\xf6ylerken a bit late ifadesi belirsizdir ve zay\u0131f durur; it slipped by a day ya da it'll land tomorrow instead denir. Gecikmeyi gizlemek yerine yeni tarihi s\xf6ylemek \u0130ngilizce konu\u015fan ekiplerde g\xfcven kazand\u0131r\u0131r.")
B.aWt=new A.r("K\u0131sa tutmak ve tart\u0131\u015fmay\u0131 ertelemek","Standup bir durum g\xfcncellemesidir, tart\u0131\u015fma yeri de\u011fildir; detaya girildi\u011fi an toplant\u0131 uzar. Tart\u0131\u015fmay\u0131 ertelemek i\xe7in let's take that offline ya da let's circle back after standup kal\u0131plar\u0131 kullan\u0131l\u0131r. Araya girmek gerekirse can I jump in quickly ile izin istenir, do\u011frudan konu\u015fmaya ba\u015flanmaz. Konu\u015furken say\u0131 ve ad vermek g\xfcncellemeyi somutla\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r: I merged two PRs and started the third one. Kendine g\xfcvenmedi\u011finde uzun konu\u015fma e\u011filimi do\u011far; k\u0131sa ve somut c\xfcmleler tam tersine daha yetkin duyulur.")
