B.c6i=new A.bw("t-10-standup","Daily standup: doksan saniyede net olmak","Bu ad\u0131mda g\xfcnl\xfck toplant\u0131da d\xfcn\xfc, bug\xfcn\xfc ve engelini doksan saniyede anlatmay\u0131 \xf6\u011freniyorsun. Hangi zaman\u0131 nerede kullanaca\u011f\u0131n\u0131, engeli kimseyi su\xe7lamadan nas\u0131l adland\u0131raca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 ve detaya bo\u011fulmadan nas\u0131l kesece\u011fini \xe7al\u0131\u015facaks\u0131n. Standup \xe7o\u011fu T\xfcrk m\xfchendisin \u0130ngilizce konu\u015ftu\u011fu ilk d\xfczenli ortamd\u0131r, bu y\xfczden burada kazan\u0131lan g\xfcven di\u011fer t\xfcm ad\u0131mlara yay\u0131l\u0131r.",B.b6l,B.b2P,B.bsH,"Roleplay senaryosunda G\xfcnl\xfck toplant\u0131 sahnesini be\u015f kez tamamla; her turda doksan saniyeyi a\u015fma, d\xfcn i\xe7in past simple, bug\xfcn i\xe7in going to kullan ve engelini waiting on ya da blocked by ile bildir; en az bir turda let's take that offline diyerek tart\u0131\u015fmay\u0131 ertele.",B.b8B,null,null,null,null)
B.aTC=new A.r("authentication ve authorization ayn\u0131 \u015fey de\u011fildir","authentication kimin oldu\u011funu do\u011frulamakt\u0131r, authorization ise neye izni oldu\u011funu belirlemektir. Konu\u015fma dilinde auth k\u0131saltmas\u0131 ikisini de kapsar, bu y\xfczden belirsizlik oldu\u011funda tam kelimeyi s\xf6ylemek gerekir. Fiilleri de farkl\u0131d\u0131r: we authenticate a user, we authorize a request, we grant or revoke a permission. G\xfcnl\xfck dilde ikisi s\u0131k s\u0131k yetkilendirme alt\u0131nda kar\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131 i\xe7in \u0130ngilizcede yanl\u0131\u015f terimi se\xe7mek \xe7ok kolayd\u0131r ve hemen fark edilir. Bir hata anlat\u0131rken hangisinin ba\u015far\u0131s\u0131z oldu\u011funu s\xf6ylemek sorunu yar\u0131 yar\u0131ya daralt\u0131r.")
B.aSc=new A.r("Zafiyetin ya\u015fam d\xf6ng\xfcs\xfc ve fiilleri","Bir zafiyet report edilir, disclose edilir, patch edilir, mitigate edilir ve exploit edilebilir. Ge\xe7ici \xe7\xf6z\xfcm i\xe7in mitigation ya da workaround, kal\u0131c\u0131 \xe7\xf6z\xfcm i\xe7in fix ya da remediation kullan\u0131l\u0131r. S\u0131z\u0131nt\u0131 i\xe7in leak, ihlal i\xe7in breach denir ve ikisi farkl\u0131 ciddiyet ta\u015f\u0131r; ihmalk\xe2r kullan\u0131m\u0131 ekipte panik yarat\u0131r. Kimlik bilgilerini ve anahtarlar\u0131 yenilemenin teknik terimi rotate'tir: rotate credentials, rotate the keys; change your password g\xfcnl\xfck dilde do\u011frudur ama anahtar ve kimlik bilgileri i\xe7in rotate tercih edilir. \u015eifreleme ile \xf6zetlemeyi ay\u0131rmak zorunludur: parolalar hashed'dir, encrypted de\u011fil.")
B.aU6=new A.r("Telaffuz ve ton: ciddiyeti do\u011fru ayarlamak","vulnerability alt\u0131 heceyle val-n\u0131-r\u0131-bil-\u0131-ti gibi okunur, vurgu bil hecesindedir ve ba\u015ftaki l sesi yutulmaz; bu kelime s\u0131k kullan\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131 i\xe7in yanl\u0131\u015f sesi kal\u0131c\u0131 olur. cipher say-f\u0131r gibi okunur, OAuth \xe7o\u011funlukla ou-ot olarak s\xf6ylenir, JWT ise cot ya da ce-dab\u0131l-yu-ti bi\xe7iminde duyulur. Ciddiyeti anlat\u0131rken abart\u0131l\u0131 s\u0131fatlar yerine \xf6l\xe7\xfct kullan\u0131l\u0131r: this is a critical severity issue, this is low severity but worth fixing. Bir \u015feyin kesin olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131 durumda temkinli dil zorunludur: it looks like the token can be replayed, we haven't confirmed exploitation. Do\u011frulanmam\u0131\u015f bir iddiay\u0131 kesin s\xf6ylemek g\xfcvenlik konu\u015fmalar\u0131nda en pahal\u0131 hatad\u0131r.")
B.bdM=s([B.aTC,B.aSc,B.aU6],t.q)
