B.c79=new A.bw("t-11-security","G\xfcvenlik \u0130ngilizcesi: kimlik, yetki ve zafiyet dili","Bu ad\u0131mda g\xfcvenlik konular\u0131n\u0131 hem do\u011fru terimle hem de do\u011fru ciddiyetle konu\u015fmay\u0131 \xf6\u011freniyorsun. Kimlik do\u011frulama ile yetkilendirmeyi ay\u0131rabilecek, bir zafiyetin ya\u015fam d\xf6ng\xfcs\xfcn\xfc anlatabilecek ve bir olay\u0131 abartmadan ya da k\xfc\xe7\xfcmsemeden bildirebileceksin. Bu alanda yanl\u0131\u015f kelime se\xe7imi sadece kulak t\u0131rmalamaz, yanl\u0131\u015f bir teknik iddia anlam\u0131na gelir.",B.bdM,B.blC,B.bgU,"Kelime tekrar\u0131 b\xf6l\xfcm\xfcnde g\xfcvenlik kartlar\u0131n\u0131 \xe7al\u0131\u015f; ard\u0131ndan hayali bir zafiyeti bir dakikada sesli anlat: authentication m\u0131 authorization m\u0131 ba\u015far\u0131s\u0131z oldu\u011funu, ciddiyet seviyesini, ge\xe7ici azaltmay\u0131 ve do\u011frulanmam\u0131\u015f k\u0131sm\u0131 it looks like ile s\xf6yle, hacked ve very kelimelerini kullanma.",B.bp4,null,null,null,null)
B.aWc=new A.r("E\u011fitim ve de\u011ferlendirme fiilleri","Model i\xe7in train, fine-tune, evaluate, deploy ve serve fiilleri kullan\u0131l\u0131r; make a training do\u011fal de\u011fildir. Veri ile ba\u011flant\u0131 sabit edatlarla kurulur: we train a model on a dataset, we evaluate it on a held-out set, we test it against a baseline. \xc7\u0131kar\u0131m i\xe7in run inference ya da the model predicts denir; the model thinks ifadesi ancak g\xfcndelik ve gev\u015fek bir ba\u011flamda kabul edilir. A\u015f\u0131r\u0131 \xf6\u011frenme i\xe7in overfit, yetersiz \xf6\u011frenme i\xe7in underfit, veri kaymas\u0131 i\xe7in drift terimleri kullan\u0131l\u0131r. Bir sonucu bildirirken hangi veri \xfczerinde \xf6l\xe7\xfcld\xfc\u011f\xfcn\xfc s\xf6ylemek beklenir, yoksa say\u0131 anlams\u0131zd\u0131r.")
B.b0z=new A.r("Say\u0131sal iyile\u015fmeyi do\u011fru ifade etmek","Y\xfczde puan ile y\xfczde fark\u0131 \u0130ngilizcede ayr\u0131l\u0131r: accuracy went up by four percentage points, not four percent. De\u011fi\u015fimin miktar\u0131 en net bi\xe7imde by edat\u0131yla verilir: latency dropped by thirty percent, the error rate fell from nine to six percent. B\xfcy\xfckl\xfck anlat\u0131rken on the order of, roughly, give or take gibi yakla\u015f\u0131kl\u0131k i\u015faretleri kullan\u0131l\u0131r. Kar\u015f\u0131la\u015ft\u0131rmada temel \xe7izgi belirtilir: compared with the baseline, relative to the previous model. Say\u0131y\u0131 temkinli bir yap\u0131yla vermek zay\u0131fl\u0131k de\u011fil, \xf6l\xe7\xfcm belirsizli\u011fini bilen bir m\xfchendisin i\u015faretidir.")
B.aVH=new A.r("Modele insan gibi davranmamak ve temkinli iddia","Model anlamaz, bilmez, d\xfc\u015f\xfcnmez; tahmin eder, \xfcretir, s\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131r\u0131r ve hata yapar. the model understood the question yerine the model produced a correct answer ya da the model classified it correctly denir. Genel iddia yerine ko\u015fullu iddia kurmak gerekir: in our experiments, on this dataset, under these settings. Belirsizli\u011fi i\u015faretleyen kal\u0131plar burada \xe7ok kullan\u0131l\u0131r: it tends to, it often, in most cases, we haven't tested that. Bir sonucun genellenebilir olup olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 s\xf6ylemek, sonucun kendisinden daha \xf6nemlidir.")
