B.aJx=new A.O("The accuracy increased 5 percent.","The accuracy increased by 5 percentage points.","Do\u011fruluk gibi zaten y\xfczdeyle \xf6l\xe7\xfclen bir de\u011ferde art\u0131\u015f y\xfczde puanla (percentage points) verilir: %80'den %85'e \xe7\u0131k\u0131\u015f 5 percentage points'tir, 5 percent olsayd\u0131 %84 olurdu. by's\u0131z increased 5 percent de kullan\u0131l\u0131r, ama by art\u0131\u015f miktar\u0131n\u0131 netle\u015ftirir.",null)
B.aK5=new A.O("The model understood the user's intention.","The model predicted the intent correctly.","Modele insan zihni atfeden fiiller teknik tart\u0131\u015fmada yanl\u0131\u015f bir iddia ta\u015f\u0131r; g\xf6zlemlenen davran\u0131\u015f predict ya da classify ile anlat\u0131l\u0131r.",null)
B.aNI=new A.O("The model learned very good.","The model performs well on this dataset.","good s\u0131fatt\u0131r ve fiili niteleyemez; ayr\u0131ca performans\u0131n hangi veri \xfczerinde \xf6l\xe7\xfcld\xfc\u011f\xfc s\xf6ylenmeden say\u0131 anlam ta\u015f\u0131maz.",null)
