B.c60=new A.bw("t-12-ml-ai","ML ve yapay zek\xe2: sonu\xe7lar\u0131 abartmadan anlatmak","Bu ad\u0131mda model e\u011fitimi ve de\u011ferlendirmesi hakk\u0131nda \u0130ngilizce konu\u015fmay\u0131 \xf6\u011freniyorsun. Do\u011fru fiilleri kullanabilecek, say\u0131sal iyile\u015fmeyi hatas\u0131z ifade edebilecek ve modele insan gibi davranan c\xfcmlelerden ka\xe7\u0131nabileceksin. Bu alanda temkinli ve kesin dil, teknik bilgi kadar itibar kazand\u0131r\u0131r.",B.b3e,B.bst,B.bwo,"Kelime tekrar\u0131 b\xf6l\xfcm\xfcnde ML ve yapay zek\xe2 kartlar\u0131n\u0131 \xe7al\u0131\u015f; sonra bir deney sonucunu bir dakikada sesli anlat: neyi neyle e\u011fitti\u011fini, hangi sette de\u011ferlendirdi\u011fini, iyile\u015fmeyi by ve percentage point kullanarak ve sonucun ge\xe7erli oldu\u011fu s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131 in our experiments ile s\xf6yle.",B.bt5,null,null,null,null)
B.b1D=new A.r("STAR: hik\xe2yenin d\xf6rt ad\u0131m\u0131","Situation ba\u011flam\u0131, Task senin sorumlulu\u011funu, Action yapt\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131, Result \xf6l\xe7\xfclebilir sonucu anlat\u0131r. T\xfcrk adaylar genellikle Situation b\xf6l\xfcm\xfcnde \xe7ok uzun kal\u0131r ve Result b\xf6l\xfcm\xfcn\xfc hi\xe7 s\xf6ylemez; oysa m\xfclakat\xe7\u0131 sonucu bekler. Sonu\xe7 mutlaka \xf6l\xe7\xfcyle verilmelidir: we cut deployment time from forty minutes to six. Her b\xf6l\xfcm\xfc iki \xfc\xe7 c\xfcmlede tutmak toplamda iki dakikal\u0131k ideal bir cevap verir. Bu yap\u0131y\u0131 \xfc\xe7 projen i\xe7in \xf6nceden haz\u0131rlamak m\xfclakatta dil y\xfck\xfcn\xfc neredeyse s\u0131f\u0131ra indirir.")
B.aVd=new A.r("Biz ve ben dengesi","Ekip i\u015fini anlat\u0131rken s\xfcrekli we demek katk\u0131n\u0131 g\xf6r\xfcnmez k\u0131lar, s\xfcrekli I demek ise g\xfcvenilmez g\xf6sterir. Do\u011fru denge ba\u011flam\u0131 we ile, kendi eylemini I ile anlatmakt\u0131r: the team owned the migration, and I designed the rollback path. Katk\u0131n\u0131 abartmamak i\xe7in s\u0131n\u0131r c\xfcmlesi eklemek i\u015fe yarar: I didn't write the ingestion layer, but I reviewed it. T\xfcrk adaylar al\xe7akg\xf6n\xfcll\xfcl\xfck gere\u011fi katk\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131 k\xfc\xe7\xfclt\xfcr; \u0130ngilizce m\xfclakatta bu, katk\u0131n\u0131n olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131 bi\xe7iminde okunur. Sahiplenmek \xf6v\xfcnmek de\u011fildir; ne yapt\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 a\xe7\u0131k\xe7a s\xf6ylemek beklenen davran\u0131\u015ft\u0131r.")
B.aW8=new A.r("Sesli d\xfc\u015f\xfcnmek ve zaman kazanmak","A\xe7\u0131k u\xe7lu soruda sessiz kalmak yerine d\xfc\u015f\xfcnceyi sesli kurmak beklenir: let me think out loud for a second. Zaman kazand\u0131ran nazik kal\u0131plar vard\u0131r: that's a good question, let me make sure I understood the constraints. Soruyu netle\u015ftirmek zay\u0131fl\u0131k de\u011fil, olgunluk i\u015faretidir: do you mean the read path or the write path. Bilmedi\u011fin bir \u015feyi kabul etmek de bir cevapt\u0131r: I haven't worked with that directly, but here's how I'd approach it. \u0130ngilizcen i\xe7in \xf6z\xfcr dilemek asla yap\u0131lmamal\u0131d\u0131r; \xf6z\xfcr, dinleyeni performans\u0131na odaklar ve i\xe7eri\u011fini g\xf6lgeler.")
