B.aOh=new A.O("The service is connected with the database and takes the data.","The service reads from the database.","Belirsiz ba\u011flant\u0131 ve alma fiilleri y\xf6n\xfc g\xf6stermez; read from ve write to okuma ve yazma y\xf6n\xfcn\xfc tek bir fiille netle\u015ftirir.",null)
