B.c71=new A.bw("t-19-scope-negotiation","Kapsam pazarl\u0131\u011f\u0131: hay\u0131r demeden se\xe7enek sunmak","Bu ad\u0131mda \xfcr\xfcn y\xf6neticisiyle kapsam ve teslim tarihi konu\u015fmas\u0131n\u0131 \u0130ngilizce y\xfcr\xfctmeyi \xf6\u011freniyorsun. Do\u011frudan reddetmek yerine se\xe7enek sunmay\u0131, tahminini belirsizli\u011fiyle birlikte vermeyi, riskleri adland\u0131rmay\u0131 ve anla\u015f\u0131lan\u0131 yaz\u0131ya ba\u011flamay\u0131 \xe7al\u0131\u015facaks\u0131n. Bu konu\u015fma \xe7o\u011fu m\xfchendisin en zorland\u0131\u011f\u0131 yerdir \xe7\xfcnk\xfc hem teknik hem de sosyal bir dengeyi ayn\u0131 anda gerektirir.",B.bg8,B.b5w,B.b2I,"Roleplay senaryosunda Kapsam ve teslim pazarl\u0131\u011f\u0131 sahnesini \xfc\xe7 kez tamamla; her turda do\u011frudan hay\u0131r demeden iki se\xe7enek sun, tahminini aral\u0131k ve varsay\u0131mla ver, en az bir kez buffer iste ve konu\u015fmay\u0131 anla\u015f\u0131lan\u0131 \xf6zetleyen bir c\xfcmleyle kapat.",B.b4l,null,null,null,null)
B.aZK=new A.r("Cevab\u0131 vermeden y\xf6nlendirmek","Mentorlukta ama\xe7 sorunu \xe7\xf6zmek de\u011fil, kar\u015f\u0131 taraf\u0131n \xe7\xf6zmesini sa\u011flamakt\u0131r; bu y\xfczden soru kal\u0131plar\u0131 merkezdedir. what if we, have you considered, what do you think would happen if, how did you decide on this approach gibi a\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015flar kullan\u0131l\u0131r. Bu sorular ger\xe7ek sorudur, k\u0131l\u0131k de\u011fi\u015ftirmi\u015f emir de\u011fildir; cevap beklemeden devam etmek g\xfcveni bozar. Do\u011frudan s\xf6ylemen gereken yerler de vard\u0131r: g\xfcvenlik, veri kayb\u0131 ve teslim riski konular\u0131nda dolayl\u0131 konu\u015fulmaz. Y\xf6nlendirmeyle netlik aras\u0131ndaki dengeyi kurmak bu ad\u0131m\u0131n as\u0131l becerisidir.")
B.aTa=new A.r("Davran\u0131\u015fa dayal\u0131, somut geri bildirim","Geri bildirim \xfc\xe7 par\xe7al\u0131d\u0131r: durum, davran\u0131\u015f, etki. Yani ne zaman, ne yapt\u0131, ne sonu\xe7 do\u011furdu. in yesterday's review, the comments were mostly about style, and the bigger design issue didn't come up gibi bir c\xfcmle bunu kurar. Ki\u015filik yorumu yap\u0131lmaz; your code is bad ya da you are careless c\xfcmleleri hem yanl\u0131\u015f hem de i\u015fe yaramazd\u0131r. \xd6vg\xfc de ayn\u0131 yap\u0131yla somutla\u015ft\u0131r\u0131l\u0131r: the way you documented the migration saved us a lot of time. Belirsiz \xf6vg\xfc ile belirsiz ele\u015ftiri ayn\u0131 derecede bo\u015ftur; ikisi de \xf6\u011frenmeye katk\u0131 vermez.")
B.b18=new A.r("Anlamad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 fark etmek ve do\u011fru s\xf6ylemek","T\xfcrk\xe7edeki kafas\u0131 kar\u0131\u015f\u0131k ifadesi kelimesi kelimesine \xe7evrilemez; his head is confused diye bir ifade yoktur. Do\u011fru kullan\u0131m ki\u015fiyle kurulur: he seems confused about the deployment flow ya da I think there's a misunderstanding here. Kar\u015f\u0131 taraf anlamad\u0131\u011f\u0131nda su\xe7u kendine almak alan a\xe7ar: I don't think I explained that clearly, let me try again. Kontrol sorusu sormak da faydal\u0131d\u0131r: does that make sense so far, would it help if I showed an example. Anlamad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 s\xf6yleyebilen bir ortam kurmak, verdi\u011fin bilginin kendisinden daha de\u011ferlidir.")
