B.aNR=new A.O("I will explain you how the pipeline works.","Let me walk you through how the pipeline works.","explain ki\u015fiyi do\u011frudan nesne almaz; walk someone through kal\u0131b\u0131 hem do\u011fru hem de mentorlukta daha do\u011fal durur.",null)
