B.c5Y=new A.bw("t-20-mentoring","Mentorluk: soru sorarak y\xf6nlendiren geri bildirim","Bu ad\u0131mda daha junior bir m\xfchendise hem net hem de cesaret k\u0131rmadan geri bildirim vermeyi \xf6\u011freniyorsun. Cevab\u0131 do\u011frudan vermek yerine soruyla y\xf6nlendirmeyi, davran\u0131\u015fa dayal\u0131 somut geri bildirim kurmay\u0131 ve \xf6vg\xfcy\xfc de \xf6l\xe7\xfcl\xfc yapmay\u0131 \xe7al\u0131\u015facaks\u0131n. Bu, k\u0131demli role ge\xe7i\u015fte en \xe7ok de\u011ferlendirilen \u0130ngilizce becerilerinden biridir.",B.b3J,B.bfE,B.bkh,"Roleplay senaryosunda Junior'a geri bildirim sahnesini \xfc\xe7 kez tamamla; her turda en az \xfc\xe7 y\xf6nlendirici soru sor, bir geri bildirimi durum, davran\u0131\u015f ve etki s\u0131ras\u0131yla kur, bir somut \xf6vg\xfc ver ve kar\u015f\u0131 taraf anlamad\u0131\u011f\u0131nda a\xe7\u0131klamay\u0131 netle\u015ftirmeyi kendi \xfczerine al.",B.bhH,null,null,null,null)
B.aUd=new A.r("\xd6nce gereksinim, sonra \xe7izim","\u0130yi bir aday tasar\u0131ma ba\u015flamadan \xf6nce s\u0131n\u0131rlar\u0131 netle\u015ftirir: are we optimising for read or write, do we need strong consistency. Fonksiyonel ve fonksiyonel olmayan gereksinimler ayr\u0131l\u0131r ve ikincisi say\u0131yla sorulur: what latency are we targeting. Varsay\u0131m yapmak serbesttir ama y\xfcksek sesle yap\u0131lmal\u0131d\u0131r: I'll assume ten million daily active users unless you say otherwise. Bu a\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015f hem zaman kazand\u0131r\u0131r hem de m\xfclakat\xe7\u0131ya seninle \xe7al\u0131\u015fman\u0131n nas\u0131l olaca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 g\xf6sterir. Soru sormadan \xe7izime ba\u015flamak bu m\xfclakatlarda en s\u0131k yap\u0131lan ve en pahal\u0131 hatad\u0131r.")
B.aWO=new A.r("\xd6l\xe7e\u011fi say\u0131yla ve yakla\u015f\u0131k konu\u015fmak","B\xfcy\xfckl\xfckler \u0130ngilizcede yakla\u015f\u0131kl\u0131k i\u015faretleriyle s\xf6ylenir: roughly, on the order of, in the ballpark of, give or take. Birim her zaman s\xf6ylenir: ten thousand requests per second, about two kilobytes per record, five terabytes per month. Kaba hesap yaparken sesli yapmak beklenir: if each record is two kilobytes and we store a year, that's about... B\xfcy\xfckl\xfck s\u0131ralamas\u0131 i\xe7in order of magnitude terimi kullan\u0131l\u0131r ve bir tasar\u0131m\u0131n neden yetmedi\u011fini anlatmakta \xe7ok i\u015fe yarar. Say\u0131s\u0131z konu\u015fulan tasar\u0131m tart\u0131\u015fmas\u0131 havada kal\u0131r; tek bir kaba hesap bile cevab\u0131n\u0131 ciddiye ald\u0131r\u0131r.")
B.b_R=new A.r("\xd6d\xfcnle\u015fimi savunmak ve fikir de\u011fi\u015ftirmek","Tutarl\u0131l\u0131k, eri\u015filebilirlik ve b\xf6l\xfcmleme tart\u0131\u015fmas\u0131 sabit kal\u0131plarla y\xfcr\xfcr: we trade strong consistency for availability here. Kesin iddia yerine ko\u015fullu dil kullan\u0131l\u0131r: if writes are rare, a single primary is fine. M\xfclakat\xe7\u0131 itiraz etti\u011finde fikir de\u011fi\u015ftirmek zay\u0131fl\u0131k de\u011fildir; that's a fair point, I'd revise that demek olgunluk i\u015faretidir. Ama her itirazda hemen \xe7\xf6kmek de k\xf6t\xfcd\xfcr; gerek\xe7en varsa savunmal\u0131s\u0131n: I'd still keep the queue, mainly for back pressure. Bu denge, seviyeni belirleyen as\u0131l sinyaldir ve dil kal\u0131plar\u0131 olmadan kurulamaz.")
B.bho=s([B.aUd,B.aWO,B.b_R],t.q)
B.aD4=new A.p("Before I start, are we optimising for reads or writes?","Ba\u015flamadan \xf6nce, okumaya m\u0131 yazmaya m\u0131 g\xf6re eniyileme yap\u0131yoruz?","Gereksinimi netle\u015ftiren a\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015f",null)
B.ax4=new A.p("I'll assume ten million daily active users unless you say otherwise.","Aksini s\xf6ylemezseniz g\xfcnde on milyon aktif kullan\u0131c\u0131 varsayaca\u011f\u0131m.","Varsay\u0131m\u0131 sesli yapmak",null)
B.ax9=new A.p("That's roughly ten thousand writes per second at peak.","Bu, zirvede saniyede kabaca on bin yazma demek.","Yakla\u015f\u0131kl\u0131k art\u0131 birim",null)
B.aCO=new A.p("If each record is two kilobytes, that's a few hundred terabytes a year.","Her kay\u0131t iki kilobayt ise bu y\u0131lda birka\xe7 y\xfcz terabayt eder.","Kaba hesab\u0131 sesli yapmak",null)
B.aBT=new A.p("That's an order of magnitude more than a single node can handle.","Bu, tek bir d\xfc\u011f\xfcm\xfcn kald\u0131rabilece\u011finden bir b\xfcy\xfckl\xfck mertebesi fazla.","order of magnitude kullan\u0131m\u0131",null)
B.aHE=new A.p("We trade strong consistency for availability here.","Burada g\xfc\xe7l\xfc tutarl\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131 eri\u015filebilirlikle takas ediyoruz.","\xd6d\xfcnle\u015fimi tek c\xfcmlede",null)
B.aId=new A.p("That's a fair point, I'd revise that part of the design.","Hakl\u0131 bir nokta, tasar\u0131m\u0131n o k\u0131sm\u0131n\u0131 g\xf6zden ge\xe7iririm.","Fikir de\u011fi\u015ftirmeyi olgun bi\xe7imde s\xf6ylemek",null)
