B.aF6=new A.p("First, let's look at why stale data was reaching users.","\xd6nce bayat verinin kullan\u0131c\u0131lara neden ula\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131na bakal\u0131m.","S\u0131ralama kal\u0131b\u0131",null)
B.atw=new A.p("For example, when a price changed, the CDN kept serving the old page for ten minutes.","\xd6rne\u011fin bir fiyat de\u011fi\u015fti\u011finde CDN eski sayfay\u0131 on dakika daha sunuyordu.","Somut \xf6rnek",null)
B.azh=new A.p("However, this approach only pays off when the workload is read-heavy.","Ancak bu yakla\u015f\u0131m yaln\u0131zca i\u015f y\xfck\xfc okuma a\u011f\u0131rl\u0131kl\u0131ysa kar\u015f\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 verir.","Kar\u015f\u0131tl\u0131k / s\u0131n\u0131r",null)
B.aAZ=new A.p("The key point is that invalidation, not caching, is the hard part.","As\u0131l nokta \u015fu: zor olan \xf6nbellekleme de\u011fil, ge\xe7ersiz k\u0131lma.","Vurgu kal\u0131b\u0131",null)
B.aFJ=new A.p("Let's move on to how we fixed it.","\u015eimdi bunu nas\u0131l \xe7\xf6zd\xfc\u011f\xfcm\xfcze ge\xe7elim.","Maddeler aras\u0131 k\xf6pr\xfc",null)
B.asX=new A.p("To sum up, caching trades freshness for speed, so cache deliberately. Thank you, I'm happy to take questions.","\xd6zetle, \xf6nbellekleme tazeli\u011fi h\u0131za kar\u015f\u0131l\u0131k takas eder; bilin\xe7li \xf6nbellekleyin. Te\u015fekk\xfcrler, sorular\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 memnuniyetle al\u0131r\u0131m.","Kapan\u0131\u015f + soru daveti",null)
