B.aLw=new A.O("Caching is good. It makes things fast. Also invalidation is a problem. Also CDN.","First, caching cuts latency. Next, the hard part is invalidation. For example, a CDN may serve stale pages.","S\u0131ralama ve \xf6rnek kal\u0131plar\u0131 olmadan maddeler birbirine yap\u0131\u015f\u0131r; 'also\u2026 also\u2026' yap\u0131 vermez.",null)
