B.auW=new A.p("I don't have that number with me; I'll get back to you after the talk.","O say\u0131 \u015fu anda elimde yok; sunumdan sonra size d\xf6nece\u011fim.","Bilmemeyi takip s\xf6z\xfcne \xe7evirmek",null)
B.aDb=new A.p("Off the top of my head it's around two hundred milliseconds.","Akl\u0131mda kald\u0131\u011f\u0131 kadar\u0131yla iki y\xfcz milisaniye civar\u0131nda.","Tahmini a\xe7\u0131k\xe7a i\u015faretlemek",null)
B.awQ=new A.p("That's a fair point, and it's a real limitation of this design.","Hakl\u0131 bir nokta ve bu tasar\u0131m\u0131n ger\xe7ek bir s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131.","Ele\u015ftirinin ge\xe7erli k\u0131sm\u0131n\u0131 kabul",null)
B.aDg=new A.p("Maybe I didn't explain that clearly, let me rephrase it.","San\u0131r\u0131m bunu net anlatamad\u0131m, tekrar ifade edeyim.","Yanl\u0131\u015f anla\u015f\u0131lmada sorumluluk almak",null)
B.aCg=new A.p("Happy to go deeper on this afterwards so we can cover the other questions.","Di\u011fer sorular\u0131 da alabilmek i\xe7in buna sonra daha derin girebiliriz.","Tart\u0131\u015fmay\u0131 nazik\xe7e ertelemek",null)
