B.aPm=new A.O("I don't know.","I don't have that data right now; let me get back to you.","Kuru ret konu\u015fmay\u0131 kapat\u0131r; bilgiyi s\u0131n\u0131rlay\u0131p takip s\xf6z\xfc vermek hem d\xfcr\xfcst hem de g\xfcven verici bir cevapt\u0131r.",null)
B.aLQ=new A.O("You didn't understand my point.","Maybe I didn't explain that clearly, let me rephrase.","Dinleyeni su\xe7lamak salonu savunmaya ge\xe7irir; anla\u015f\u0131lmamay\u0131 kendi \xfczerine almak tart\u0131\u015fmay\u0131 i\xe7erikte tutar.",null)
B.aNK=new A.O("Actually, that is not correct.","I see it slightly differently, and here's why.","actually ile ba\u015flayan d\xfczeltme \xfcstten bir ton ta\u015f\u0131r; farkl\u0131 g\xf6rd\xfc\u011f\xfcn\xfc s\xf6yleyip gerek\xe7e vermek ayn\u0131 itiraz\u0131 \xe7at\u0131\u015fmas\u0131z kurar.",null)
