B.aQn=new A.O("What are you doing tonight? /\u02c8w\u0252t \u02c8\u0251\u02d0 \u02c8ju\u02d0 \u02c8du\u02d0\u026a\u014b/","What are you doing tonight? /\u02c8w\u0252t\u0283\u0259 \u02c8du\u02d0\u026a\u014b/","Soru ba\u015flang\u0131\xe7lar\u0131 konu\u015fmada en \xe7ok s\u0131k\u0131\u015fan yerdir: what are you tek par\xe7a h\xe2linde whatcha gibi s\xf6ylenir. D\xf6rt kelimeyi de tam ve e\u015fit vurguyla okumak hem yava\u015flat\u0131r hem de ezberden okunuyormu\u015f izlenimi verir. Yaz\u0131da c\xfcmle ayn\u0131 kal\u0131r; whatcha yaln\u0131zca sesi g\xf6steren g\xfcndelik bir yaz\u0131md\u0131r.",null)
