B.c6q=new A.bw("g-a08-karaoke-mastery","On \u015fark\u0131: ritmi, nefesi ve \u015fark\u0131 dilini sahiplenmek","Bu ad\u0131mda on \u015fark\u0131y\u0131 y\xfcksek skorla tamamlayarak \u0130ngilizcenin ritmini art\u0131k d\xfc\u015f\xfcnmeden uygulayacak h\xe2le geliyorsun. Nefesi nerede alaca\u011f\u0131n\u0131, hangi \xfcnl\xfcleri eritece\u011fini ve sat\u0131r\u0131 nas\u0131l tek ak\u0131\u015fta bitirece\u011fini \xf6\u011freneceksin. Ayr\u0131ca \u015fark\u0131 dilinin kendine has \xf6zg\xfcrl\xfcklerini tan\u0131yacaks\u0131n: devrik yap\u0131lar, d\xfc\u015fen \xf6zneler ve standart d\u0131\u015f\u0131 gramer. Ama\xe7 \u015fark\u0131c\u0131 gibi s\xf6ylemek de\u011fil, \u015fark\u0131n\u0131n verdi\u011fi tempoyu kendi konu\u015fmana ta\u015f\u0131makt\u0131r.",B.boe,B.by5,B.b3a,"Karaoke b\xf6l\xfcm\xfcnde on \u015fark\u0131y\u0131 y\xfczde yetmi\u015f be\u015f \xfcst\xfcnde bitir: \u015fark\u0131lar\u0131 farkl\u0131 tempo ve aksanlardan se\xe7, her \u015fark\u0131da s\xf6zleri \xf6nce nefes noktalar\u0131n\u0131 i\u015faretleyerek oku, skorun d\xfc\u015ft\xfc\u011f\xfc sat\u0131r\u0131 be\u015f kez tek ba\u015f\u0131na \xe7al\u0131\u015f ve bir \u015fark\u0131y\u0131 hedefe ula\u015ft\u0131rmadan di\u011ferine ge\xe7me.",B.j,null,null,null,null)
B.aSB=new A.r("Hedging: iddian\u0131n dozunu ayarlamak","Akademik yaz\u0131da g\xfc\xe7, kesin konu\u015fmaktan de\u011fil, ne kadar kesin konu\u015ftu\u011funu do\u011fru ayarlamaktan gelir. suggest, indicate, appear to, tend to, may, is likely to, relatively ve to some extent bu ayar\u0131 yapan ara\xe7lard\u0131r. 'The findings prove' yerine 'The findings suggest' yazmak zay\u0131fl\u0131k de\u011fil, veriye sayg\u0131d\u0131r ve okur bunu yetkinlik olarak okur. Birden fazla hedge \xfcst \xfcste binebilir: 'The data appear to indicate a relatively modest effect' c\xfcmlesi \xfc\xe7 katman \xe7ekince ta\u015f\u0131r. T\xfcrk \xf6\u011frenciler s\u0131nav al\u0131\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131yla g\xfc\xe7l\xfc ve mutlak c\xfcmleler kurmay\u0131 iyi yaz\u0131 san\u0131r; akademik de\u011ferlendirmede bu tam tersi etki yapar. Metni bitirince her iddia c\xfcmlesi i\xe7in kendine sor: elimdeki kan\u0131t bu kadar kesin konu\u015fmama izin veriyor mu.")
B.aWP=new A.r("\u0130simle\u015ftirme: fiili isme \xe7evirip yo\u011funla\u015ft\u0131rmak","Akademik \u0130ngilizce olaylar\u0131 fiil yerine isimle anlatmay\u0131 sever, \xe7\xfcnk\xfc isim c\xfcmlenin \xf6znesi olup \xfczerine yeni bilgi y\u0131\u011f\u0131labilir. 'Prices rose sharply, which caused unrest' c\xfcmlesi 'The sharp rise in prices caused unrest' h\xe2line gelir ve hem k\u0131sal\u0131r hem yo\u011funla\u015f\u0131r. S\u0131k kullan\u0131lan d\xf6n\xfc\u015f\xfcmler: increase, reduction, failure, assumption, implementation, interpretation ve emergence. Ancak her \u015feyi isimle\u015ftirmek metni okunmaz yapar; pe\u015f pe\u015fe \xfc\xe7 isimle\u015ftirme varsa birini fiile geri \xe7evir. T\xfcrk\xe7e de isimle\u015ftirmeyi sever, bu y\xfczden bu yap\u0131 T\xfcrk \xf6\u011frencilere yabanc\u0131 gelmez; as\u0131l risk dozunu ka\xe7\u0131rmakt\u0131r. \xd6l\xe7\xfc basit: c\xfcmlede en az bir ger\xe7ek ve anlaml\u0131 fiil kals\u0131n.")
B.aZg=new A.r("Cleft yap\u0131lar ve vurgu y\xf6netimi","Cleft yap\u0131 bir c\xfcmleyi ikiye b\xf6l\xfcp bir par\xe7as\u0131n\u0131 sahneye \xe7\u0131kar\u0131r ve akademik yaz\u0131da \xe7ok i\u015fe yarar. 'It is the sample size, rather than the method, that limits the conclusions' c\xfcmlesi as\u0131l sorunu tek hamlede i\u015faretler. What ile kurulan bi\xe7im eksik kalan\u0131 \xf6ne \xe7\u0131kar\u0131r: 'What this study does not address is the long-term cost.' Bu yap\u0131lar ayn\u0131 zamanda bilgi ak\u0131\u015f\u0131n\u0131 d\xfczenler: c\xfcmlenin ba\u015f\u0131na bilinen, sonuna yeni bilgi gelir. T\xfcrk\xe7ede vurgu kelime s\u0131ras\u0131yla ve y\xfcklem \xf6ncesi konumla yap\u0131l\u0131r, \u0130ngilizcede ise bu i\u015f b\xfcy\xfck \xf6l\xe7\xfcde yap\u0131ya d\xfc\u015fer. Bir paragrafta bir cleft yeterlidir; art arda gelirse metin yapay ve \u0131srarl\u0131 duyulur.")
B.b_U=new A.r("Participle c\xfcmlecikleri ve akademik k\u0131sal\u0131k","Having reviewed the data, Based on these findings ve Given the limited sample gibi a\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015flar iki c\xfcmleyi tek c\xfcmlede toplar. 'Having controlled for income, the researchers found no significant difference' c\xfcmlesi hem k\u0131sa hem \xfcst d\xfczeydir. Bu yap\u0131n\u0131n tek ama ciddi bir kural\u0131 vard\u0131r: participle \xf6be\u011finin gizli \xf6znesi ile ana c\xfcmlenin \xf6znesi ayn\u0131 olmal\u0131d\u0131r. 'Having analysed the results, the conclusion was clear' c\xfcmlesi bu kural\u0131 \xe7i\u011fner, \xe7\xfcnk\xfc analizi yapan sonu\xe7 de\u011fildir. \u0130stisna: given ve considering kal\u0131pla\u015f\u0131p edat gibi \xe7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r ve bu kurala tabi de\u011fildir, based on da \xe7o\u011fu zaman \xf6yle kabul edilir ama tart\u0131\u015fmal\u0131d\u0131r; bu y\xfczden 'Given the limited data, any generalisation should be treated with caution' do\u011frudur. T\xfcrk \xf6\u011frenciler bu yap\u0131y\u0131 s\xfcs olarak kullan\u0131p \xf6zneyi ka\xe7\u0131r\u0131r ve c\xfcmle s\u0131navda dilbilgisi hatas\u0131 olarak i\u015faretlenir. Yazd\u0131ktan sonra tek kontrol yeter: bu eylemi kim yapt\u0131, o ki\u015fi ana c\xfcmlenin \xf6znesi mi.")
