B.aJ7=new A.O("This dress fits you very much.","That dress really suits you.","fit bedenin uydu\u011funu, suit ise yak\u0131\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 anlat\u0131r; ayr\u0131ca very much bu yap\u0131da kullan\u0131lmaz, peki\u015ftirici really olur.",null)
B.aPM=new A.O("You are very beautiful.","That was a really clear summary \u2014 thanks for writing it up.","Ofiste bir i\u015f arkada\u015f\u0131na s\xf6ylendi\u011finde g\xf6r\xfcn\xfc\u015f \xf6vg\xfcs\xfc s\u0131n\u0131r ihlali olarak okunabilir; g\xfcvenli ve etkili iltifat her zaman i\u015fe, fikre ya da yakla\u015f\u0131ma yap\u0131l\u0131r.",null)
B.aKC=new A.O("Thank you, but it is nothing, really nothing.","Thanks, that's kind of you \u2014 I'm glad it worked.","T\xfcrk\xe7edeki esta\u011ffurullah refleksini \xe7evirmek \u0130ngilizcede \xf6vg\xfcy\xfc geri \xe7evirmek olur; beklenen davran\u0131\u015f te\u015fekk\xfcr etmek ve k\u0131sa bir ayr\u0131nt\u0131 eklemektir.",null)
B.aJa=new A.O("I want to do you a compliment.","I wanted to pay you a compliment.","compliment fiil e\u015fi pay ya da give'd\u0131r; do a compliment yap\u0131s\u0131 yoktur ve bu hata c\xfcmleyi \xe7eviri kokutan tipik bir e\u015fdizim hatas\u0131d\u0131r. I wanted to ise iste\u011fi yumu\u015fatan kibar bir bi\xe7imdir; I want to pay you a compliment da do\u011frudur.",null)
B.bg7=s([B.aJ7,B.aPM,B.aKC,B.aJa],t.Z)
B.c69=new A.bw("so-03-compliments","\u0130ltifat: e\u015fdizim, s\u0131n\u0131r ve gelen \xf6vg\xfcy\xfc kar\u015f\u0131lama","Bu ad\u0131mda iltifat kelimelerini liste olarak de\u011fil, birlikte kullan\u0131ld\u0131klar\u0131 fiil ve yap\u0131larla \xf6\u011freniyorsun. \u0130ngilizcede iltifat\u0131n g\xfcc\xfc s\u0131fat\u0131n b\xfcy\xfckl\xfc\u011f\xfcnden de\u011fil, neyi \xf6vd\xfc\u011f\xfcnden ve hangi yap\u0131yla kuruldu\u011fundan gelir: suits you, looks good on you, you've got an eye for gibi bloklar haz\u0131r gelmedi\u011finde c\xfcmle abart\u0131l\u0131 ya da tuhaf durur. Ayr\u0131ca T\xfcrk\xe7e konu\u015fanlar\u0131n en \xe7ok zorland\u0131\u011f\u0131 iki nokta var: iltifat\u0131 kabul etme bi\xe7imi ve i\u015f ortam\u0131ndaki s\u0131n\u0131rlar. Bu ders iltifat\u0131 i\xe7ten, \xf6l\xe7\xfcl\xfc ve g\xfcvenli kurmay\u0131 \xf6\u011fretir.",B.baT,B.byh,B.bg7,"Kelime tekrar\u0131 b\xf6l\xfcm\xfcnde iltifat paketini e\u015fdizim odakl\u0131 \xe7al\u0131\u015f: her kart\u0131n \xf6n\xfcne kelimeyi de\u011fil blo\u011fu yaz (suits you, looks good on you, have an eye for, pull off, pay a compliment) ve arkas\u0131na kendi \xe7evrenden ger\xe7ek bir c\xfcmle kur. Kartlar\u0131 \xfc\xe7 k\xfcmede grupla: g\xf6r\xfcn\xfc\u015f, beceri, karakter; g\xf6r\xfcn\xfc\u015f k\xfcmesine ayr\u0131ca hangi ortamda kullan\u0131lamayaca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 not et. Her iltifat\u0131n alt\u0131na bir de kabul cevab\u0131 yaz (Thanks, that's kind of you) ve peki\u015fen kartlarda write modunu kullanarak c\xfcmleyi ba\u015ftan \xfcret.",B.j,null,null,null,null)
B.aS5=new A.r("Hamle s\u0131ras\u0131: sinyal, okuma, davet","\u0130lgi \xf6nce d\xfc\u015f\xfck riskli sinyalle verilir: ortak noktay\u0131 b\xfcy\xfctmek (Wait, you're into bouldering too?), s\xfcreyi uzatmak (I could keep talking about this all night), k\xfc\xe7\xfck bir iltifat eklemek. \u0130kinci ad\u0131m sinyal okumakt\u0131r: kar\u015f\u0131 taraf soru soruyor, kendinden bilgi veriyor ve konu\u015fmay\u0131 s\xfcrd\xfcr\xfcyorsa ye\u015fil \u0131\u015f\u0131kt\u0131r; k\u0131sa cevaplar, kapal\u0131 beden dili ve konu de\u011fi\u015ftirme k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 \u0131\u015f\u0131kt\u0131r. \xdc\xe7\xfcnc\xfc ad\u0131m somut davettir ve \xfc\xe7 par\xe7as\u0131 vard\u0131r: eylem, zaman aral\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve ka\xe7\u0131\u015f pay\u0131. I'd love to grab a coffee sometime \u2014 are you around this weekend? c\xfcmlesinde ilk ikisi vard\u0131r; sonuna No pressure, though eklemek \xfc\xe7\xfcnc\xfcs\xfcn\xfc tamamlar. Ka\xe7\u0131\u015f pay\u0131 b\u0131rakmak zorunludur: no pressure, if you're up for it, if you're free gibi ekler kar\u015f\u0131 taraf\u0131n rahat reddetmesini sa\u011flar ve bu nezaket olarak okunur. Daveti sonunda bir kanala ba\u011fla: Should I get your number, or is Instagram easier? Numara istemek soru bi\xe7iminde ve se\xe7enekli olmal\u0131d\u0131r.")
B.aYd=new A.r("Reddetmek ve reddi kar\u015f\u0131lamak","Kibar ret \xfc\xe7 par\xe7al\u0131d\u0131r: te\u015fekk\xfcr ya da olumlu bir c\xfcmle, net ama yumu\u015fak ret, kapan\u0131\u015f. That's really sweet of you, but I'm not looking for anything right now \u2014 I hope you find someone great. Haz\u0131r kal\u0131plar i\u015fi kolayla\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r: I'd love to, but... (istiyorum ama olmaz), I'm going to pass on this one (bu sefer yok), I don't think that's for me, I'm flattered, but... Retlerin bir k\u0131sm\u0131 kesin, bir k\u0131sm\u0131 kap\u0131y\u0131 aral\u0131k b\u0131rak\u0131r; fark\u0131 bilmek \xf6nemlidir: I can't this weekend, maybe another time aral\u0131k b\u0131rak\u0131r, I don't think we're looking for the same thing kapat\u0131r. Sana ret geldiyse tek do\u011fru hamle kabul etmektir: No worries at all \u2014 good to meet you. Israr etmek, sebep sormak ya da a\xe7\u0131klama istemek \u0130ngilizce sosyal kodda ciddi bir s\u0131n\u0131r ihlalidir. Belirsiz cevaplar (I'll let you know, We'll see, I'm super busy these days) \xe7o\u011fu zaman nazik bir rettir; ikinci kez sormak yerine topu b\u0131rakmak beklenen davran\u0131\u015ft\u0131r.")
B.aUV=new A.r("Tonu ayarlamak: fazla resm\xeeden fazla ileriye kadar","Bu alan\u0131n dili \xe7ok hassas bir \xf6l\xe7ekte durur: bir yanda fazla resm\xee (Would you care to accompany me to dinner?), di\u011fer yanda fazla ileri ve rahats\u0131z edici c\xfcmleler vard\u0131r. G\xfcvenli b\xf6lge somut, hafif ve d\xfc\u015f\xfck bask\u0131l\u0131 c\xfcmlelerdir: Any chance you'd want to check out that place on Friday? Bu yap\u0131 hem net hem rahat reddedilebilir. G\xf6r\xfcn\xfc\u015fle ilgili c\xfcmleler ilk a\u015famada risklidir; ki\u015fili\u011fe, se\xe7ime ve mizaha yap\u0131lan yorum daha g\xfcvenli ve daha etkilidir. Are you seeing anyone? sorusu do\u011fal ama zaman\u0131 vard\u0131r: sohbet belirli bir s\xfcre akt\u0131\u011f\u0131nda sorulur, tan\u0131\u015fman\u0131n ilk dakikas\u0131nda sorgu gibi durur. Sinyalleri yanl\u0131\u015f okuduysan geri ad\u0131m c\xfcmlesi haz\u0131r olmal\u0131: Sorry, I misread that \u2014 no worries at all. Bu c\xfcmle durumu tek hamlede kapat\u0131r.")
B.beG=s([B.aS5,B.aYd,B.aUV],t.q)
