B.aNJ=new A.O("You are very beautiful, give me your number.","I've had a really good time \u2014 could I get your number?","Emir kipiyle kurulan istek \u0130ngilizcede bask\u0131 yarat\u0131r; numara her zaman soru bi\xe7iminde ve sohbete dayand\u0131r\u0131larak istenir.",null)
