B.c6U=new A.bw("so-04-flirt","\u0130lgi g\xf6sterme, davet etme ve daveti kibarca reddetme","Bu ad\u0131mda ilgi g\xf6stermenin, birini bir \u015feye davet etmenin ve gelen daveti k\u0131rmadan reddetmenin hamlelerini \xf6\u011freniyorsun. Bu alan\u0131n dili do\u011frudanl\u0131kla de\u011fil dereceyle \xe7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r: \xf6nce ilgi sinyali verilir, kar\u015f\u0131 taraftan gelen sinyal okunur, sonra somut bir davet kurulur. T\xfcrk\xe7e konu\u015fanlar\u0131n iki tipik sorunu var: daveti fazla do\u011frudan kurmak (Do you want to be my girlfriend?) ve reddi fazla net s\xf6ylemek (No, I don't want). \u0130ngilizcede her iki y\xf6nde de ara katmanlar vard\u0131r ve bu ders o katmanlar\u0131 \xf6\u011fretir.",B.beG,B.bA6,B.bdV,"Roleplay senaryosunda fl\xf6rt ve ilgi g\xf6sterme sahnelerini be\u015f kez tamamla: bir etkinlikte tan\u0131\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131n biri, bir spor salonunda k\u0131sa kar\u015f\u0131la\u015fma, uygulamadan gelen ilk mesaj, davetin kabul edildi\u011fi bir sahne ve davetin reddedildi\u011fi bir sahne. Her turda s\u0131ray\u0131 bozmadan \xe7al\u0131\u015f: d\xfc\u015f\xfck riskli bir ilgi sinyali ver, kar\u015f\u0131 taraf\u0131n sinyalini s\xf6zle \xf6zetle, eylem + zaman i\xe7eren bir davet kur ve ka\xe7\u0131\u015f pay\u0131 ekle. En az iki turda reddi sen ver ve kal\u0131b\u0131 tam kullan (olumlu c\xfcmle + yumu\u015fak s\u0131n\u0131r + kapan\u0131\u015f); bir turda gelen reddi tek c\xfcmleyle kabul edip sahneyi kapat.",B.bbJ,null,null,null,null)
B.aTR=new A.r("Hik\xe2yenin zaman iskeleti","Bir hik\xe2ye \xfc\xe7 zaman katman\u0131yla kurulur: sahneyi past continuous kurar (I was living in Izmir at the time), olaylar\u0131 past simple ta\u015f\u0131r (then I got a call), olaydan \xf6ncesini past perfect verir (I had already signed the contract). Bu s\u0131ralama anlat\u0131y\u0131 anla\u015f\u0131l\u0131r yapan as\u0131l \u015feydir; her \u015feyi past simple ile anlatmak olaylar\u0131 ayn\u0131 d\xfczleme y\u0131\u011far ve dinleyici neyin ne zaman oldu\u011funu kaybeder. Anlat\u0131y\u0131 canland\u0131rmak i\xe7in s\u0131k kullan\u0131lan bir teknik konu\u015fma dilinde \u015fimdiki zamana ge\xe7mektir: So I walk in, and he's just standing there. Bu yap\u0131 yanl\u0131\u015f de\u011fil, bilin\xe7li bir anlat\u0131m arac\u0131d\u0131r. Zaman belirte\xe7leri iskeleti d\u0131\u015far\u0131dan g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcr k\u0131lar: at the time, by then, a couple of years earlier, right after that, eventually. Hik\xe2yeye ba\u015flarken \xe7er\xe7eve c\xfcmlesi kur: This is going to sound strange, but... ya da I've never really told anyone this. \xc7er\xe7eve dinleyiciye ne t\xfcr bir hik\xe2ye geldi\u011fini s\xf6yler.")
B.aTt=new A.r("Derin sohbeti a\xe7an sorular ve payla\u015f\u0131m dozu","Derin sohbeti a\xe7an sorular olgu de\u011fil deneyim sorar: What's something you're really into these days? What was the turning point for you? What would you do differently? Payla\u015f\u0131m kar\u015f\u0131l\u0131kl\u0131 ve kademelidir: sen bir ad\u0131m a\xe7\u0131l\u0131rs\u0131n, kar\u015f\u0131 taraf a\xe7\u0131l\u0131rsa bir ad\u0131m daha gidersin. Tek tarafl\u0131 ve erken derinle\u015fme (ilk yar\u0131m saatte travma anlatmak) kar\u015f\u0131 taraf\u0131 geriletir. Duyguyu adland\u0131rmak hik\xe2yeyi derin yapar: I was relieved, honestly, It stung more than I expected, I felt completely out of my depth. Kendini hakl\u0131 \xe7\u0131karmadan anlatmak g\xfcven kurar: Looking back, I handled it badly c\xfcmlesi anlat\u0131c\u0131y\u0131 g\xfc\xe7s\xfcz de\u011fil g\xfcvenilir g\xf6sterir. Konu\u015fmay\u0131 kapatmadan b\u0131rakmak da bir hamledir: Anyway, that's the short version \u2014 ask me the long one sometime.")
B.aXG=new A.r("Dinleyici hamleleri: derinle\u015ftirmek","Derin sohbette iyi dinleyicinin \xfc\xe7 hamlesi vard\u0131r: yans\u0131t, adland\u0131r, derinle\u015ftir. Yans\u0131tma kar\u015f\u0131 taraf\u0131n s\xf6yledi\u011fini kendi c\xfcmlenle geri verir (So you basically started over). Adland\u0131rma duyguyu s\xf6yler: That must have been exhausting, I imagine that was a relief. Bu c\xfcmleler yarg\u0131 de\u011fil e\u015flik kurar. Derinle\u015ftirme sorusu olaydan anlam\u0131na ge\xe7er: What did that teach you? How do you feel about it now? What's changed since then? Hemen \xe7\xf6z\xfcm \xf6nermek derin sohbeti kapat\u0131r; \u0130ngilizcede \xf6nce izin istenir: Do you want advice, or do you just want to vent? Bu soru \xe7ok de\u011ferlidir. Sessizli\u011fe izin ver; derin sohbette bir iki saniyelik bo\u015fluk beceriksizlik de\u011fil, kar\u015f\u0131 tarafa yer a\xe7makt\u0131r.")
