B.aNY=new A.O("When I have arrived, he had already gone.","When I arrived, he had already gone.","Ge\xe7mi\u015fteki belirli bir an\u0131 anlatan when c\xfcmlesinde present perfect kullan\u0131lmaz, past simple kullan\u0131l\u0131r (When I arrived); o andan \xf6ncesini anlatan zaman ise past perfect'tir ve already bu yap\u0131n\u0131n tipik e\u015flik\xe7isidir. he was already gone da do\u011frudur: orada gone, gitmi\u015f ve ortada yok anlam\u0131nda bir s\u0131fatt\u0131r.",null)
