B.c6Z=new A.bw("so-06-disagree","Kibarca itiraz: sertlik \xf6l\xe7e\u011fi ve yumu\u015fat\u0131c\u0131 s\xf6zc\xfckler","Bu ad\u0131mda kar\u015f\u0131 \xe7\u0131kman\u0131n kelime da\u011farc\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 sertlik seviyelerine g\xf6re \xf6\u011freniyorsun. \u0130ngilizcede itiraz\u0131n g\xfcc\xfc kelimenin anlam\u0131ndan de\u011fil, c\xfcmleye ekledi\u011fin yumu\u015fat\u0131c\u0131lardan \xe7\u0131kar: ayn\u0131 fikir I disagree ile s\xf6ylendi\u011finde sert, I'm not sure I'd go that far ile s\xf6ylendi\u011finde tart\u0131\u015fmaya davet olur. T\xfcrk\xe7e konu\u015fanlar i\xe7in as\u0131l zorluk \xe7eviri de\u011fil doz: T\xfcrk\xe7ede do\u011fal olan Bu do\u011fru de\u011fil c\xfcmlesinin birebir kar\u015f\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131 That's not true \u0130ngilizcede beklenenden \xe7ok daha sert duyulur. Bu ad\u0131mda hem yumu\u015fat\u0131c\u0131 s\xf6zc\xfck havuzunu hem taviz-verip-d\xf6n (concede and pivot) yap\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 kuracaks\u0131n.",B.b5B,B.b9l,B.bfA,"Kelime tekrar\u0131 b\xf6l\xfcm\xfcnde itiraz ve yumu\u015fatma paketini \xe7al\u0131\u015f: her kart\u0131n \xf6n\xfcne tam bir c\xfcmle, arkas\u0131na sertlik kademesini (1\u20135) ve uygun ortam\u0131 yaz. Kartlar\u0131 \xfc\xe7 k\xfcmede topla: yumu\u015fat\u0131c\u0131lar (maybe, sort of, I'd say, I could be wrong), taviz kal\u0131plar\u0131 (that's a fair point, up to a point, in a way) ve d\xf6n\xfc\u015f ba\u011fla\xe7lar\u0131 (but, that said, although, whereas). Her oturumda bir sert c\xfcmleyi (That's wrong) be\u015f kademeye d\xf6n\xfc\u015ft\xfcrme al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rmas\u0131 yap ve peki\u015fen kartlarda write modunu kullanarak c\xfcmleyi ba\u015ftan \xfcret; kal\u0131plar\u0131 sesli tekrar ederek tonu da \xe7al\u0131\u015f.",B.b65,null,null,null,null)
B.aSD=new A.r("Arg\xfcman iskeleti: iddia, gerek\xe7e, kan\u0131t, sonu\xe7","Tek bir arg\xfcman d\xf6rt par\xe7adan olu\u015fur ve bu s\u0131ra bozulmaz: iddia (My position is that...), gerek\xe7e (The reason is that...), kan\u0131t (For example, in 2023...), sonu\xe7 (So overall...). \u0130ddiay\u0131 tek c\xfcmlede kur ve \u015fart\u0131n\u0131 s\xf6yle: I'd argue that remote work helps retention, at least for senior roles. \u015earts\u0131z iddia ilk itirazda y\u0131k\u0131l\u0131r. Kan\u0131t t\xfcr\xfcn\xfc adland\u0131rmak arg\xfcman\u0131 g\xfc\xe7lendirir: there's data showing, a clear example is, in my own experience. \u0130\xe7lerinde en zay\u0131f\u0131 ki\u015fisel deneyimdir, o y\xfczden son s\u0131raya koy. Sinyal s\xf6zc\xfckleri dinleyiciye harita verir: First and foremost, Secondly, More importantly, Finally. Bu i\u015faretler olmadan iyi bir arg\xfcman da\u011f\u0131n\u0131k duyulur. Sonu\xe7 c\xfcmlesi arg\xfcman\u0131 kapat\u0131r ve tart\u0131\u015fma boyunca ayn\u0131 kelimelerle tekrarlanabilir; bu tekrar zay\u0131fl\u0131k de\u011fil, pozisyonu hat\u0131rlatmakt\u0131r.")
B.aTD=new A.r("\xc7\xfcr\xfctme: arg\xfcman\u0131 adland\u0131r, sonra k\u0131r","\u0130yi \xe7\xfcr\xfctme \xfc\xe7 ad\u0131ml\u0131d\u0131r: kar\u015f\u0131 arg\xfcman\u0131 kendi c\xfcmlenle \xf6zetle, hangi par\xe7as\u0131na kar\u015f\u0131 \xe7\u0131kt\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 s\xf6yle, gerek\xe7eni ver. \xd6zetleme kal\u0131plar\u0131 haz\u0131r olmal\u0131: If I understand you correctly, you're saying that..., Your argument rests on the idea that... Sonra zay\u0131f noktay\u0131 adland\u0131r: That assumes the cost stays flat, That's true in theory, but it doesn't hold at scale, You're comparing two different things there. Kabul edip a\u015fmak g\xfc\xe7l\xfc bir hamledir: Even if that's true, it doesn't change the main point. Bu yap\u0131 kar\u015f\u0131 taraf\u0131n kan\u0131t\u0131n\u0131 tart\u0131\u015fmadan arg\xfcman\u0131 ge\xe7ersizle\u015ftirir. Devil's advocate ifadesi kendi g\xf6r\xfc\u015f\xfcn olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 s\xf6yleyerek kar\u015f\u0131 \xe7\u0131kman\u0131 sa\u011flar: Let me play devil's advocate for a second. Tart\u0131\u015fmay\u0131 ki\u015fiselle\u015ftirmeden sertle\u015ftirmenin en temiz yolu budur.")
B.b0W=new A.r("S\xf6z almak, s\u0131ray\u0131 korumak, kapatmak","S\xf6z alma kal\u0131plar\u0131 kesmek de\u011fil, i\u015faret vermektir: Can I jump in here? Sorry, just one thing on that. Kal\u0131b\u0131 s\xf6yleyip beklemeden devam etmek kabad\u0131r, ama hi\xe7 s\xf6ylememek de konu\u015fmay\u0131 ka\xe7\u0131rmakt\u0131r. S\xf6z\xfcn kesildi\u011finde geri almak da bir kal\u0131pt\u0131r: Let me just finish this thought, Hold on, I was going somewhere with that. Konuyu geri toplamak i\xe7in let's circle back to ve to get back to your earlier point kullan\u0131l\u0131r; da\u011f\u0131lan tart\u0131\u015fmay\u0131 toplayan taraf genellikle kazanan taraft\u0131r. Zaman ve kan\u0131t s\u0131n\u0131rlar\u0131n\u0131 kabul etmek g\xfcven verir: I don't have the figure in front of me, but the direction is clear. Bilmedi\u011fini s\xf6ylemek arg\xfcman\u0131 de\u011fil, g\xfcvenilirli\u011fini etkiler. Kapan\u0131\u015f \xf6zeti iki c\xfcmledir: pozisyonunu yeniden s\xf6yle ve tek en g\xfc\xe7l\xfc gerek\xe7eni tekrar et; yeni arg\xfcman a\xe7mak kapan\u0131\u015f\u0131 zay\u0131flat\u0131r.")
B.bbI=s([B.aSD,B.aTD,B.b0W],t.q)
B.aEw=new A.p("My position is that remote work helps retention, at least for senior roles.","Benim pozisyonum \u015fu: uzaktan \xe7al\u0131\u015fma, en az\u0131ndan k\u0131demli roller i\xe7in \xe7al\u0131\u015fan tutmay\u0131 iyile\u015ftiriyor.","\u0130ddia + \u015fart: \u015farts\u0131z iddia hemen y\u0131k\u0131l\u0131r",null)
B.ax5=new A.p("First and foremost, the hiring pool gets much bigger.","Her \u015feyden \xf6nce i\u015fe al\u0131m havuzu \xe7ok daha b\xfcy\xfcyor.","Sinyal s\xf6zc\xfc\u011f\xfc dinleyiciye harita verir",null)
B.azg=new A.p("If I understand you correctly, you're saying costs would rise.","Do\u011fru anlad\u0131ysam maliyetlerin artaca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 s\xf6yl\xfcyorsun.","\xc7\xfcr\xfctmenin birinci ad\u0131m\u0131: \xf6zetle",null)
B.aBi=new A.p("That assumes the cost stays flat, though.","Ama bu, maliyetin sabit kalaca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 varsay\u0131yor.","Varsay\u0131m\u0131 adland\u0131rmak en etkili \xe7\xfcr\xfctme",null)
B.aAk=new A.p("Even if that's true, it doesn't change the main point.","Bu do\u011fru olsa bile ana noktay\u0131 de\u011fi\u015ftirmiyor.","Kabul et ve a\u015f: kan\u0131t tart\u0131\u015fmas\u0131na girmeden ge\xe7ersizle\u015ftirir",null)
B.aBb=new A.p("Let me play devil's advocate for a second.","Bir an i\xe7in \u015feytan\u0131n avukatl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 yapay\u0131m.","Kendi g\xf6r\xfc\u015f\xfcn\xfc riske atmadan kar\u015f\u0131 \xe7\u0131kma",null)
B.ayc=new A.p("Can I jump in here? Just one thing on that.","Araya girebilir miyim? Sadece tek bir \u015fey s\xf6yleyece\u011fim.","S\xf6z alma kal\u0131b\u0131: s\xf6yle ve k\u0131sa bir an bekle",null)
B.axR=new A.p("So to come back to my main point: the data supports it.","Ana noktama d\xf6necek olursam: veriler bunu destekliyor.","Kapan\u0131\u015f: yeni arg\xfcman a\xe7madan pozisyonu tekrarla",null)
