B.aQA=new A.O("I think so remote work is good because it is good for everybody.","I'd argue remote work improves retention, mainly because the hiring pool is wider.","Gerek\xe7esi kendini tekrar eden iddia arg\xfcman say\u0131lmaz; m\xfcnazarada her iddia ayr\u0131 bir gerek\xe7e ve m\xfcmk\xfcnse bir kan\u0131tla desteklenir. Ayr\u0131ca bir dil bilgisi hatas\u0131 var: I think so k\u0131sa cevap olarak tek ba\u015f\u0131na kullan\u0131l\u0131r, \xe7\xfcnk\xfc so, arkas\u0131na gelecek that c\xfcmlesinin tamam\u0131n\u0131n yerini tutar (I think so.); arkas\u0131ndan c\xfcmle geliyorsa so d\xfc\u015fer: I think remote work is good. Do\u011fru c\xfcmledeki I'd argue ise m\xfcnazarada iddiay\u0131 daha net kuran bir \xe7er\xe7evedir.",null)
B.aQr=new A.O("You don't understand the topic.","I think we're using the word productivity differently.","Ki\u015fiye y\xf6nelen sald\u0131r\u0131 arg\xfcman\u0131 de\u011fil konu\u015fmac\u0131y\u0131 hedef al\u0131r ve tart\u0131\u015fmay\u0131 kaybettirir; itiraz her zaman arg\xfcman\u0131n bir par\xe7as\u0131na ba\u011flan\u0131r.",null)
B.aO1=new A.O("Mm-hmm... right... mm-hmm.","Sorry, can I jump in? I want to pick up on that last point.","Kar\u015f\u0131 taraf uzun konu\u015furken yaln\u0131zca mm-hmm gibi onay sesleriyle bekleyip hi\xe7 s\xf6z almamak \u0130ngilizce tart\u0131\u015fmada i\u015fe yaramaz: s\xf6z almak kabal\u0131k de\u011fil beklenen davran\u0131\u015ft\u0131r, s\u0131ra kendili\u011finden gelmez ve hi\xe7 araya girmemek katk\u0131s\u0131z kalmak olarak okunur.",null)
B.aLK=new A.O("According to me, the government must do it.","In my view, the government should take the lead on this.","according to yaln\u0131zca ba\u015fka bir kaynak i\xe7in kullan\u0131l\u0131r, kendi g\xf6r\xfc\u015f\xfcn i\xe7in de\u011fil; ayr\u0131ca must yerine should tart\u0131\u015fmada daha savunulabilir bir iddia kurar.",null)
