B.aQd=new A.O("It's raining cats and dogs outside.","It's absolutely pouring out there.","Ders kitaplar\u0131ndan \xf6\u011frenilen bu deyim g\xfcnl\xfck konu\u015fmada neredeyse kullan\u0131lmaz ve kullan\u0131l\u0131nca ezberlenmi\u015f izlenimi verir; do\u011fal ve her yerde anla\u015f\u0131lan kar\u015f\u0131l\u0131klar\u0131 it's pouring ya da it's really coming down'd\u0131r.",null)
