B.aPd=new A.O("Great job.","Great job \ud83d\ude43 (or spell it out: that was sarcasm, by the way)","Bir hatadan sonra mesajda sarkazmla yaz\u0131lan Great job. ton ta\u015f\u0131maz: i\u015faret eklenmedi\u011finde kar\u015f\u0131 taraf c\xfcmleyi ger\xe7ek \xf6vg\xfc ya da ciddi ele\u015ftiri olarak okur ve mesaj tamamen ters anla\u015f\u0131l\u0131r.",null)
