B.aOF=new A.c0("I am in the bus.","I am on the bus.",'Otob\xfcs, tren, u\xe7ak \u2192 on. Araba, taksi \u2192 in. (Sebep: otob\xfcs\xfcn i\xe7inde "y\xfczey" hissi var.)','For buses, trains, and planes, English uses "on". For cars and taxis, it uses "in". Think of "on" as riding a surface/platform.')
B.aNk=new A.c0("I was born in 15 May.","I was born on 15 May.","Tam tarih (g\xfcn dahil) \u2192 on. Sadece ay \u2192 in May.",'A full date (including the day) requires "on". "In" is used for months and years alone.')
B.aOr=new A.c0("See you in Monday.","See you on Monday.","G\xfcnler i\xe7in \u2192 on.",'Days of the week always take "on".')
