B.aOM=new A.c0("I have many informations.","I have a lot of information.",'"information" say\u0131lamayan \u2014 \xe7o\u011ful almaz, "much/a lot of" al\u0131r.','"Information" is an uncountable noun and has no plural. Use "a lot of" or "much" instead of "many".')
B.bb4=s([B.aOM],t.gr)
B.cdB=new A.f8("\xc7o\u011ful: -s, -es, -ies","\xc7o\u011funlukla -s eklenir. -s/-sh/-ch/-x/-o biten isimler -es al\u0131r. \xdcns\xfcz + y biten isimler y \u2192 i + es olur.","Normal: book \u2192 books\n-s/-sh/-ch/-x/-o: bus \u2192 buses, box \u2192 boxes\n\xdcns\xfcz + y: city \u2192 cities (y \u2192 i + es)\nSesli + y: boy \u2192 boys\n\u0130stisnalar: child \u2192 children, mouse \u2192 mice, foot \u2192 feet","Say\u0131labilir isimleri \xe7o\u011fulla\u015ft\u0131r. Say\u0131lamayan isimler (water, information, advice) \xe7o\u011ful almaz.",B.bxz,B.bb4,"Say\u0131lamayan isim listesini \xf6\u011fren: water, money, advice, news, furniture, information. Bunlar hep tekil g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcr ama \xe7o\u011ful anlam ta\u015f\u0131r.","Plurals: -s, -es, -ies","Most nouns add -s. Nouns ending in -s, -sh, -ch, -x, or -o add -es. Nouns ending in consonant + y change y to i and add -es.","Use plural forms with countable nouns. Uncountable nouns (water, information, advice) have no plural.","Turkish speakers often pluralise uncountable nouns by analogy with Turkish. Memorise the key uncountable nouns: water, money, advice, news, furniture, information, luggage, equipment, traffic. These never take -s and always use singular verbs.","Normal: book \u2192 books\n-s/-sh/-ch/-x/-o: bus \u2192 buses, box \u2192 boxes\nConsonant + y: city \u2192 cities (y \u2192 i + es)\nVowel + y: boy \u2192 boys\nExceptions: child \u2192 children, mouse \u2192 mice, foot \u2192 feet")
